            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Deathwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-1">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-fa-javelin-1-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Deathwing" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-1-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>With a sword-type weapon against an enemy whose Weapon Skill is higher than the model’s own, re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in close combat. If The Unbroken Vow is selected: a Deathwing unit within 6" of an Objective gains Feel No Pain (6+), or improves existing Feel No Pain by one step to a maximum of 4+; a Deathwing Independent Character within 12" of an Objective gains +1 Attack.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Dreadwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-2">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-fa-javelin-2-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Dreadwing" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-2-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Flame, Plasma and Volkite attacks against this unit are -1 Strength (minimum 1); against Dreadwing Vehicles/Dreadnoughts this also reduces Armour Penetration Strength. If The Eskaton Imperative is selected: Dreadwing Infantry gain Move Through Cover and all Dreadwing models may re-roll failed Dangerous Terrain tests.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ironwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-3">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-fa-javelin-3-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ironwing" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-3-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against enemy Vehicles. Ironwing Vehicles firing Snap Shots hit on 5+ instead of 6+. If The Steel Fist is selected: a Transport Vehicle carrying an Ironwing Independent Character gains a 6+ Invulnerable Save against shooting, or improves an existing Invulnerable Save by one step to a maximum of 4+.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Firewing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-4">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-fa-javelin-4-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Firewing" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-4-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 when attacking an enemy unit containing an Independent Character, in shooting and close combat. If The Serpent’s Bane is selected: against a nominated Priority Target, Firewing models re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 and To Wound rolls of 1 (Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against Vehicles); a Firewing Independent Character gains +1 Attack in melee with a Priority Target. Up to three Firewing Troops units may select Forward Deployment — Infiltrate.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ravenwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-5">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-fa-javelin-5-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ravenwing" id="da-wing-fa-javelin-5-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Dark Angels Bikes and Jetbikes gain Skilled Rider; Dark Angels Land Speeders gain Jink. If The Seeker’s Arrow is selected: Ravenwing Infantry, Bikes and Jetbikes gain Outflank; Ravenwing Bikes and Jetbikes gain Hit &amp; Run. At the start of each Dark Angels turn choose +2" Turbo-Boost/Advance, +2" Charge, or +2" Consolidation for all Ravenwing units until the next Dark Angels turn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
          </ns0:selectionEntries>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
      </ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
    <ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" name="Legion Heavy Support Squad" id="hs-heavy-support-squad" hidden="false" import="true">
      <ns0:categoryLinks>
