            <ns0:rule name="Hardened Armour (entire squad)" id="hs-hss-hardened-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Failed Armour Saves caused by Blast or Template weapons may be re-rolled. Reduce Advance additional distance, Charge distance and Pursuit distance by 1". Counts as Void Hardened where applicable.</ns0:description>
