        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Hexagrammaton Wing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator" collective="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="min" />
            <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:modifiers>
            <ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
              <ns0:conditions>
                <ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </ns0:conditions>
            </ns0:modifier>
            <ns0:modifier type="set" value="1" field="da-wing-hs-vindicator-min">
              <ns0:conditions>
                <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </ns0:conditions>
            </ns0:modifier>
          </ns0:modifiers>
          <ns0:selectionEntries>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Stormwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-0">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-0-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Stormwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-0-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>First Fire/Overwatch: re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 with Bolters, Bolt Pistols, Storm Bolters, Foeblaster Boltguns and bolter component of combi-weapons. If The Storm of War is selected: stationary Stormwing units also use the Stormwing re-roll during the normal Shooting phase; Stormwing Infantry containing a Stormwing Character gains Stubborn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Deathwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-1">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-1-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Deathwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-1-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>With a sword-type weapon against an enemy whose Weapon Skill is higher than the model’s own, re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in close combat. If The Unbroken Vow is selected: a Deathwing unit within 6" of an Objective gains Feel No Pain (6+), or improves existing Feel No Pain by one step to a maximum of 4+; a Deathwing Independent Character within 12" of an Objective gains +1 Attack.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Dreadwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-2">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-2-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Dreadwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-2-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Flame, Plasma and Volkite attacks against this unit are -1 Strength (minimum 1); against Dreadwing Vehicles/Dreadnoughts this also reduces Armour Penetration Strength. If The Eskaton Imperative is selected: Dreadwing Infantry gain Move Through Cover and all Dreadwing models may re-roll failed Dangerous Terrain tests.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ironwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-3">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-3-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ironwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-3-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against enemy Vehicles. Ironwing Vehicles firing Snap Shots hit on 5+ instead of 6+. If The Steel Fist is selected: a Transport Vehicle carrying an Ironwing Independent Character gains a 6+ Invulnerable Save against shooting, or improves an existing Invulnerable Save by one step to a maximum of 4+.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Firewing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-4">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-4-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Firewing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-4-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 when attacking an enemy unit containing an Independent Character, in shooting and close combat. If The Serpent’s Bane is selected: against a nominated Priority Target, Firewing models re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 and To Wound rolls of 1 (Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against Vehicles); a Firewing Independent Character gains +1 Attack in melee with a Priority Target. Up to three Firewing Troops units may select Forward Deployment — Infiltrate.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ravenwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-5">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-5-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ravenwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-5-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Dark Angels Bikes and Jetbikes gain Skilled Rider; Dark Angels Land Speeders gain Jink. If The Seeker’s Arrow is selected: Ravenwing Infantry, Bikes and Jetbikes gain Outflank; Ravenwing Bikes and Jetbikes gain Hit &amp; Run. At the start of each Dark Angels turn choose +2" Turbo-Boost/Advance, +2" Charge, or +2" Consolidation for all Ravenwing units until the next Dark Angels turn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
          </ns0:selectionEntries>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
      <ns0:selectionEntryGroup id="r40-da-ammo-hs-vindicator" name="Dark Angels Armoury — Ammunition" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:entryLinks><ns0:entryLink id="r40-da-ammo-hs-vindicator-hs-vind-p6" name="Molecular Acid Shells (for Heavy Bolter)" type="selectionEntry" targetId="da22-acid-hb" hidden="true" import="true"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r40-da-ammo-hs-vindicator-hs-vind-p6-max" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="7" /></ns0:costs><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="false" field="hidden"><ns0:conditionGroups><ns0:conditionGroup type="and"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" /><ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-vind-p6" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:conditionGroup></ns0:conditionGroups></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers></ns0:entryLink></ns0:entryLinks></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
    <ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" name="Legion Land Raider Battle Squadron" id="hs-land-raider" hidden="false" import="true">
      <ns0:categoryLinks>
        <ns0:categoryLink targetId="cat-heavy" id="hs-land-raider-cat" primary="true" name="Heavy Support" hidden="false" />
      </ns0:categoryLinks>
      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule name="Squadron Composition" id="hs-lr-comp-rule" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>Select 1–3 Land Raiders. Any may be Phobos or Proteus patterns; no more than one may be an Achilles.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
      <ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Land Raider Patterns" id="hs-lr-patterns" hidden="false">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-patterns-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-patterns-max" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:selectionEntries>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="model" name="Land Raider Phobos" id="hs-lr-phobos" hidden="false" import="true">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-phobos-max" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:costs>
                <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="250" />
              </ns0:costs>
              <ns0:profiles>
                <ns0:profile name="Land Raider Phobos" id="hs-lr-phobos-prof" typeId="prof-vehicle" typeName="Vehicle" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:characteristics>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="vehicle-bs">4</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="Front" typeId="vehicle-front">14</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="Side" typeId="vehicle-side">14</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="Rear" typeId="vehicle-rear">14</ns0:characteristic>
                  </ns0:characteristics>
                </ns0:profile>
                <ns0:profile name="Twin-linked Lascannon" id="hs-lr-phobos-las" typeId="prof-ranged" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:characteristics>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">48"</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">9</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">2</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Heavy 1, Twin-linked</ns0:characteristic>
                  </ns0:characteristics>
                </ns0:profile>
                <ns0:profile name="Twin-linked Heavy Bolter" id="hs-lr-phobos-hb" typeId="prof-ranged" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:characteristics>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">36"</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">5</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">4</ns0:characteristic>
                    <ns0:characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Heavy 3, Twin-linked</ns0:characteristic>
                  </ns0:characteristics>
                </ns0:profile>
              </ns0:profiles>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Standard Wargear" id="hs-lr-phobos-wg" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Two Twin-linked Lascannons, Twin-linked Heavy Bolter, Searchlight and Smoke Launchers. Power of the Machine Spirit; Assault Vehicle; Transport Capacity 10.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
                <ns0:rule name="Assault Vehicle" id="hs-lr-phobos-assault-vehicle" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Units may charge after disembarking as allowed by ProHammer.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
              <ns0:selectionEntries>
                <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Hunter-Killer Missile" id="hs-lr-ph-up-hunter-killer-missile" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <ns0:constraints>
                    <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-ph-up-hunter-killer-missile-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </ns0:constraints>
                  <ns0:modifiers>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="2" field="hs-lr-ph-up-hunter-killer-missile-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="2" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="3" field="hs-lr-ph-up-hunter-killer-missile-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="3" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                  </ns0:modifiers>
                  <ns0:costs>
                    <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" />
                  </ns0:costs>
                  <ns0:rules>
                    <ns0:rule name="Hunter-Killer Missile" id="hs-lr-ph-up-hunter-killer-missile-rule" hidden="false">
                      <ns0:description>Unlimited range, S8 AP3, Heavy 1, One Use.</ns0:description>
                    </ns0:rule>
                  </ns0:rules>
                </ns0:selectionEntry>
                <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Dozer Blade" id="hs-lr-ph-up-dozer-blade" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <ns0:constraints>
                    <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-ph-up-dozer-blade-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </ns0:constraints>
                  <ns0:modifiers>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="2" field="hs-lr-ph-up-dozer-blade-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="2" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="3" field="hs-lr-ph-up-dozer-blade-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="3" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                  </ns0:modifiers>
                  <ns0:costs>
                    <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" />
                  </ns0:costs>
                  <ns0:rules>
                    <ns0:rule name="Dozer Blade" id="hs-lr-ph-up-dozer-blade-rule" hidden="false">
                      <ns0:description>Use the normal ProHammer Dozer Blade rule.</ns0:description>
                    </ns0:rule>
                  </ns0:rules>
                </ns0:selectionEntry>
                <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Extra Armour" id="hs-lr-ph-up-extra-armour" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <ns0:constraints>
                    <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-ph-up-extra-armour-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </ns0:constraints>
                  <ns0:modifiers>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="2" field="hs-lr-ph-up-extra-armour-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="2" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="3" field="hs-lr-ph-up-extra-armour-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="3" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                  </ns0:modifiers>
                  <ns0:costs>
                    <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" />
                  </ns0:costs>
                  <ns0:rules>
                    <ns0:rule name="Extra Armour" id="hs-lr-ph-up-extra-armour-rule" hidden="false">
                      <ns0:description>Use the normal ProHammer Extra Armour rule.</ns0:description>
                    </ns0:rule>
                  </ns0:rules>
                </ns0:selectionEntry>
                <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Auxiliary Drive" id="hs-lr-ph-up-auxiliary-drive" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <ns0:constraints>
                    <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-ph-up-auxiliary-drive-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </ns0:constraints>
                  <ns0:modifiers>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="2" field="hs-lr-ph-up-auxiliary-drive-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="2" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="3" field="hs-lr-ph-up-auxiliary-drive-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="3" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                  </ns0:modifiers>
                  <ns0:costs>
                    <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" />
                  </ns0:costs>
                  <ns0:rules>
                    <ns0:rule name="Auxiliary Drive" id="hs-lr-ph-up-auxiliary-drive-rule" hidden="false">
                      <ns0:description>At the start of the controlling player's Movement phase, if the vehicle is Immobilised, roll a D6. On a 4+, remove one Immobilised result; it may move normally that phase.</ns0:description>
                    </ns0:rule>
                  </ns0:rules>
                </ns0:selectionEntry>
                <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Armoured Ceramite" id="hs-lr-ph-up-armoured-ceramite" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <ns0:constraints>
                    <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-ph-up-armoured-ceramite-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </ns0:constraints>
                  <ns0:modifiers>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="2" field="hs-lr-ph-up-armoured-ceramite-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="2" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="3" field="hs-lr-ph-up-armoured-ceramite-max">
                      <ns0:conditions>
                        <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="3" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-lr-phobos" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </ns0:conditions>
                    </ns0:modifier>
                  </ns0:modifiers>
                  <ns0:costs>
                    <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" />
                  </ns0:costs>
                  <ns0:rules>
                    <ns0:rule name="Armoured Ceramite" id="hs-lr-ph-up-armoured-ceramite-rule" hidden="false">
                      <ns0:description>Melta weapons do not receive their additional Armour Penetration die against this vehicle, regardless of range.</ns0:description>
                    </ns0:rule>
                  </ns0:rules>
                </ns0:selectionEntry>
              </ns0:selectionEntries>
              <ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
                <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Pintle-mounted Weapon" id="hs-lr-ph-pintle" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:constraints>
                    <ns0:constraint id="hs-lr-ph-pintle-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                  </ns0:constraints>
                  <ns0:modifiers>
                    <ns0:modifier type="set" value="2" field="hs-lr-ph-pintle-max">
