        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Hexagrammaton Wing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran" collective="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="min" />
            <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:modifiers>
            <ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
              <ns0:conditions>
                <ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </ns0:conditions>
            </ns0:modifier>
            <ns0:modifier type="set" value="1" field="da-wing-hs-sicaran-min">
              <ns0:conditions>
                <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </ns0:conditions>
            </ns0:modifier>
          </ns0:modifiers>
          <ns0:selectionEntries>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Stormwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-0">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-0-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Stormwing" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-0-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>First Fire/Overwatch: re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 with Bolters, Bolt Pistols, Storm Bolters, Foeblaster Boltguns and bolter component of combi-weapons. If The Storm of War is selected: stationary Stormwing units also use the Stormwing re-roll during the normal Shooting phase; Stormwing Infantry containing a Stormwing Character gains Stubborn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Deathwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-1">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-1-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Deathwing" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-1-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>With a sword-type weapon against an enemy whose Weapon Skill is higher than the model’s own, re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in close combat. If The Unbroken Vow is selected: a Deathwing unit within 6" of an Objective gains Feel No Pain (6+), or improves existing Feel No Pain by one step to a maximum of 4+; a Deathwing Independent Character within 12" of an Objective gains +1 Attack.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Dreadwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-2">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-2-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Dreadwing" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-2-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Flame, Plasma and Volkite attacks against this unit are -1 Strength (minimum 1); against Dreadwing Vehicles/Dreadnoughts this also reduces Armour Penetration Strength. If The Eskaton Imperative is selected: Dreadwing Infantry gain Move Through Cover and all Dreadwing models may re-roll failed Dangerous Terrain tests.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ironwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-3">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-3-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ironwing" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-3-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against enemy Vehicles. Ironwing Vehicles firing Snap Shots hit on 5+ instead of 6+. If The Steel Fist is selected: a Transport Vehicle carrying an Ironwing Independent Character gains a 6+ Invulnerable Save against shooting, or improves an existing Invulnerable Save by one step to a maximum of 4+.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Firewing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-4">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-4-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Firewing" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-4-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 when attacking an enemy unit containing an Independent Character, in shooting and close combat. If The Serpent’s Bane is selected: against a nominated Priority Target, Firewing models re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 and To Wound rolls of 1 (Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against Vehicles); a Firewing Independent Character gains +1 Attack in melee with a Priority Target. Up to three Firewing Troops units may select Forward Deployment — Infiltrate.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ravenwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-5">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-5-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ravenwing" id="da-wing-hs-sicaran-5-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Dark Angels Bikes and Jetbikes gain Skilled Rider; Dark Angels Land Speeders gain Jink. If The Seeker’s Arrow is selected: Ravenwing Infantry, Bikes and Jetbikes gain Outflank; Ravenwing Bikes and Jetbikes gain Hit &amp; Run. At the start of each Dark Angels turn choose +2" Turbo-Boost/Advance, +2" Charge, or +2" Consolidation for all Ravenwing units until the next Dark Angels turn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
          </ns0:selectionEntries>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
      <ns0:selectionEntryGroup id="r40-da-ammo-hs-sicaran" name="Dark Angels Armoury — Ammunition" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:entryLinks><ns0:entryLink id="r40-da-ammo-hs-sicaran-hs-sicaran-sp-hb" name="Molecular Acid Shells (for Heavy Bolter Sponsons)" type="selectionEntry" targetId="da22-acid-hb" hidden="true" import="true"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r40-da-ammo-hs-sicaran-hs-sicaran-sp-hb-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="7" /></ns0:costs><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="false" field="hidden"><ns0:conditionGroups><ns0:conditionGroup type="and"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" /><ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-sicaran-sp-hb" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:conditionGroup></ns0:conditionGroups></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers></ns0:entryLink><ns0:entryLink id="r40-da-ammo-hs-sicaran-hs-sicaran-p6" name="Molecular Acid Shells (for Heavy Bolter)" type="selectionEntry" targetId="da22-acid-hb" hidden="true" import="true"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r40-da-ammo-hs-sicaran-hs-sicaran-p6-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="7" /></ns0:costs><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="false" field="hidden"><ns0:conditionGroups><ns0:conditionGroup type="and"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" /><ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-sicaran-p6" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:conditionGroup></ns0:conditionGroups></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers></ns0:entryLink></ns0:entryLinks></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
      <ns0:selectionEntries>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Hunter-Killer Missile" id="hs-sicaran-hunter-killer-missile" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-sicaran-hunter-killer-missile-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Hunter-Killer Missile" id="hs-sicaran-hunter-killer-missile-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Unlimited range, S8 AP3, Heavy 1, One Use.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Dozer Blade" id="hs-sicaran-dozer-blade" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-sicaran-dozer-blade-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Dozer Blade" id="hs-sicaran-dozer-blade-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Use the normal ProHammer Dozer Blade rule.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Auxiliary Drive" id="hs-sicaran-auxiliary-drive" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-sicaran-auxiliary-drive-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Auxiliary Drive" id="hs-sicaran-auxiliary-drive-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>On a 4+ at the start of the Movement phase, remove one Immobilised result.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Armoured Ceramite" id="hs-sicaran-armoured-ceramite" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-sicaran-armoured-ceramite-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Armoured Ceramite" id="hs-sicaran-armoured-ceramite-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Melta weapons do not gain an additional Armour Penetration die against this vehicle.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
      </ns0:selectionEntries>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
    <ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" name="Deredeo Pattern Dreadnought" id="hs-deredeo" hidden="false" import="true">
      <ns0:categoryLinks>
        <ns0:categoryLink targetId="cat-heavy" id="hs-deredeo-cat" primary="true" name="Heavy Support" hidden="false" />
      </ns0:categoryLinks>
      <ns0:costs>
        <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="185" />
      </ns0:costs>
      <ns0:profiles>
        <ns0:profile name="Deredeo Dreadnought" id="hs-deredeo-prof" typeId="prof-walker" typeName="Walker" hidden="false">
          <ns0:characteristics>
            <ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="walker-ws">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="walker-bs">5</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="walker-s">6</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Front" typeId="walker-front">13</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Side" typeId="walker-side">12</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Rear" typeId="walker-rear">11</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="walker-i">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="walker-a">1</ns0:characteristic>
          </ns0:characteristics>
        </ns0:profile>
        <ns0:profile name="Anvilus Autocannon Battery" id="hs-deredeo-anvilus" typeId="prof-ranged" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false">
          <ns0:characteristics>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">48"</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">8</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Heavy 4</ns0:characteristic>
          </ns0:characteristics>
        </ns0:profile>
      </ns0:profiles>
      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule name="Standard Wargear" id="hs-deredeo-wg" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>Anvilus Autocannon Battery, Twin-linked Heavy Bolter, Extra Armour, Searchlight and Smoke Launchers.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
        <ns0:rule name="Atomantic Shielding" id="hs-deredeo-atomantic" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>Each time the vehicle suffers a Glancing or Penetrating Hit from shooting, on a 5+ the hit is ignored; in close combat, on a 6+ it is ignored. Roll before the Vehicle Damage table. If it suffers an Explodes! result, add +1" to the explosion radius.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
        <ns0:rule name="Helical Targeting Array" id="hs-deredeo-helical" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>At the beginning of the controlling player's turn, the Deredeo may activate the array. If it does, it must remain stationary that turn and its ranged weapons gain Skyfire and Interceptor until the beginning of its next turn.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
        <ns0:rule name="Plasma Overload" id="hs-deredeo-overload" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>After firing the Hellfire Plasma Cannonade in Maximal mode, roll a D6. On a 1, the Deredeo suffers an automatic Glancing Hit; this hit may not be prevented by cover saves or Atomantic Shielding.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      </ns0:rules>
      <ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Primary Battery" id="hs-deredeo-primary" hidden="false">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-primary-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:entryLinks>
            <ns0:entryLink name="Hellfire Plasma Cannonade" id="hs-deredeo-hellfire" type="selectionEntry" targetId="hsgear-hellfire" hidden="false" import="true">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-hellfire-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:costs>
                <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="35" />
              </ns0:costs>
            </ns0:entryLink>
            <ns0:entryLink name="Arachnus Heavy Lascannon Battery" id="hs-deredeo-arachnus" type="selectionEntry" targetId="hsgear-arachnus" hidden="false" import="true">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-arachnus-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:costs>
                <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="50" />
              </ns0:costs>
            </ns0:entryLink>
          </ns0:entryLinks>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Secondary Weapon" id="hs-deredeo-secondary" hidden="false">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-secondary-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:entryLinks>
            <ns0:entryLink name="Twin-linked Heavy Flamer (replaces Twin-linked Heavy Bolter)" id="hs-deredeo-hf" type="selectionEntry" targetId="hsgear-tl-heavy-flamer" hidden="false" import="true">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-hf-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </ns0:constraints>
            </ns0:entryLink>
          </ns0:entryLinks>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Carapace System" id="hs-deredeo-carapace" hidden="false">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-carapace-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:entryLinks>
            <ns0:entryLink name="Aiolos Missile Launcher" id="hs-deredeo-aiolos" type="selectionEntry" targetId="hsgear-aiolos" hidden="false" import="true">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-aiolos-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:costs>
                <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="35" />
              </ns0:costs>
            </ns0:entryLink>
          </ns0:entryLinks>
          <ns0:selectionEntries>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Atomantic Pavaise" id="hs-deredeo-pavaise" hidden="false" import="true">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-pavaise-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:costs>
                <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="50" />
              </ns0:costs>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Atomantic Pavaise" id="hs-deredeo-pavaise-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Improves Atomantic Shielding against shooting from 5+ to 4+. Friendly Infantry within 3" gain a 6+ Invulnerable Save against shooting; if they already have an Invulnerable Save, improve it by 1 to a maximum of 3+.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
          </ns0:selectionEntries>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Hexagrammaton Wing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo" collective="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="min" />
            <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:modifiers>
            <ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
              <ns0:conditions>
                <ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </ns0:conditions>
            </ns0:modifier>
            <ns0:modifier type="set" value="1" field="da-wing-hs-deredeo-min">
              <ns0:conditions>
                <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </ns0:conditions>
            </ns0:modifier>
          </ns0:modifiers>
          <ns0:selectionEntries>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Stormwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-0">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-0-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Stormwing" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-0-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>First Fire/Overwatch: re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 with Bolters, Bolt Pistols, Storm Bolters, Foeblaster Boltguns and bolter component of combi-weapons. If The Storm of War is selected: stationary Stormwing units also use the Stormwing re-roll during the normal Shooting phase; Stormwing Infantry containing a Stormwing Character gains Stubborn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Deathwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-1">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-1-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Deathwing" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-1-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>With a sword-type weapon against an enemy whose Weapon Skill is higher than the model’s own, re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in close combat. If The Unbroken Vow is selected: a Deathwing unit within 6" of an Objective gains Feel No Pain (6+), or improves existing Feel No Pain by one step to a maximum of 4+; a Deathwing Independent Character within 12" of an Objective gains +1 Attack.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Dreadwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-2">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-2-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Dreadwing" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-2-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Flame, Plasma and Volkite attacks against this unit are -1 Strength (minimum 1); against Dreadwing Vehicles/Dreadnoughts this also reduces Armour Penetration Strength. If The Eskaton Imperative is selected: Dreadwing Infantry gain Move Through Cover and all Dreadwing models may re-roll failed Dangerous Terrain tests.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ironwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-3">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-3-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ironwing" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-3-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against enemy Vehicles. Ironwing Vehicles firing Snap Shots hit on 5+ instead of 6+. If The Steel Fist is selected: a Transport Vehicle carrying an Ironwing Independent Character gains a 6+ Invulnerable Save against shooting, or improves an existing Invulnerable Save by one step to a maximum of 4+.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Firewing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-4">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-4-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Firewing" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-4-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 when attacking an enemy unit containing an Independent Character, in shooting and close combat. If The Serpent’s Bane is selected: against a nominated Priority Target, Firewing models re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 and To Wound rolls of 1 (Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against Vehicles); a Firewing Independent Character gains +1 Attack in melee with a Priority Target. Up to three Firewing Troops units may select Forward Deployment — Infiltrate.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ravenwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-5">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-5-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ravenwing" id="da-wing-hs-deredeo-5-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Dark Angels Bikes and Jetbikes gain Skilled Rider; Dark Angels Land Speeders gain Jink. If The Seeker’s Arrow is selected: Ravenwing Infantry, Bikes and Jetbikes gain Outflank; Ravenwing Bikes and Jetbikes gain Hit &amp; Run. At the start of each Dark Angels turn choose +2" Turbo-Boost/Advance, +2" Charge, or +2" Consolidation for all Ravenwing units until the next Dark Angels turn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
          </ns0:selectionEntries>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
      </ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
      <ns0:selectionEntries>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Armoured Ceramite" id="hs-deredeo-ceramite" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="hs-deredeo-ceramite-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Armoured Ceramite" id="hs-deredeo-ceramite-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Melta weapons do not gain an additional Armour Penetration die against this vehicle.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
      </ns0:selectionEntries>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
