                  <ns0:description>May only be selected for an eligible HQ character equipped with Terminator, Tartaros or Cataphractii Terminator Armour. It occupies no separate Force Organisation slot; the character and squad count as one HQ selection but may deploy and operate separately.</ns0:description>
