          <ns0:description>Power Armour; Legion Scimitar Jetbike with Heavy Bolter; Bolt Pistol; Chainsword; Frag Grenades.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
        <ns0:rule name="Legiones Astartes &amp; Deep Strike" id="r40-da-arrow-sky-fa-sky-la" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>Legiones Astartes and Deep Strike. The unit also has And They Shall Know No Fear as presented in ProHammer Classic and is not Fearless.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      <ns0:rule id="r40-da-arrow-sky-rite-rule" name="Ravenwing Host" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Selected as a Troops choice by The Seeker’s Arrow. This Rite-specific copy is fixed to the Ravenwing. It gains Outflank and Hit &amp; Run while the Rite is active.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules>
