Phoenix Champion | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Phoenix Terminators
• 1 Phoenix Champion
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Phoenix Champion is a Character
Wargear:
• Tartaros Terminator Armour
• Phoenix Spear
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children)
• Implacable Advance
• Stubborn
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Phoenix Terminators
for +45 points per model.
• One Phoenix Terminator may take:
• Doom Siren ................................... +15 points
• The Phoenix Champion may take:
• Grenade Harness .............................. +10 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Spartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="45" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +45 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="for" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squad-opt-0-for"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squad-opt-0-for-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="45" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The squad may include up to five additional Phoenix Terminators</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Doom Siren" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squ