es><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Kakophoni | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 1 | 10 | 3+
Cacophonic Champion | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 2 | 10 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Heavy Support
CACOPHONY If an enemy unit suffers one or more casualties from shooting attacks made by a Kakophoni Squad, it must take a Pinning test after the squad has finished firing.
Unit Composition:
• 5 Kakophoni
• 1 Cacophonic Champion
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Cacophonic Champion is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Sonic Blaster
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children)
• Fearless
• Cacophony
Restriction:
• Traitor armies only
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to six additional Kakophoni
for +25 points per model.
• For every three models in the squad, one Kakophoni may replace his Sonic Blaster with:
• Blastmaster .................................. +15 points
• The Cacophonic Champion may replace his Sonic Blaster with:
• Doom Siren and bolt pistol .................. Free
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades .............................. +2 points per model
• The Cacophonic Champion may take:
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• Power fist ................................... +15 points
• Melta bombs .................................. +5 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad of ten models or fewer may select a Rhino, Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="6" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 6 additional models at +25 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="for" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-opt-0-for"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-opt-0-for-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The squad may include up to six additional Kakophoni</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Blastmaster" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-opt-1-blastmaster"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-sq