cs></ns0:profile><ns0:profile name="Sun Killer Prefector" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-profile-1"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Sun Killer | 4 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 9 | 3+
Sun Killer Prefector | 4 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 10 | 3+
Force Organisation:
EXEMPLARY MARKSMEN Once during each friendly Shooting phase, the Sun Killer Squad may re-roll one failed shooting To Hit roll. The second result must be accepted.
• Heavy Support
Unit Composition:
• 4 Sun Killers
• 1 Sun Killer Prefector
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Sun Killer Prefector is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Lascannon
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children)
• Exemplary Marksmen
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Sun Killers
for +50 points per model.
ENERGY WEAPONS
The entire squad may replace all of its Lascannons with one of the following:
• Plasma Cannons ................................. -5 points per model
• Volkite Culverins .............................. -15 points per model
Every model in the squad must carry the same Heavy weapon.
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades .............................. +2 points per model
• The Sun Killer Prefector may take:
• Artificer Armour ............................. +10 points
• Melta bombs .................................. +5 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino as a Dedicated Transport.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="50" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +50 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="for" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-opt-0-for"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-opt-0-for-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="50" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The squad may include up to five additional Sun Killers</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Plasma Cannons (base unit; -5 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-opt-1-plasma-cannons"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-opt-1-