Falcon’s Claw Leader | 4 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 4+
Force Organisation:
SABOTAGE After both armies have deployed but before the first game turn begins, nominate one enemy unit, Vehicle or Fortification on the battlefield. An Independent Character may not be selected unless it is part of another unit. The target suffers D6 Strength 5 AP6 hits. Against Vehicles or Fortifications, resolve these hits against the lowest Armour Value. Casualties caused by Sabotage do not cause Morale or Pinning tests.
• Fast Attack
• 0–1 Falcon's Claws Squad
Unit Composition:
• 4 Falcon's Claws
• 1 Falcon's Claw Leader
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Falcon's Claw Leader is a Character
Wargear:
• Recon Armour
• M.40 Stalker Bolter
• Bolt pistol
• Combat Blade
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (White Scars)
• Scout
• Infiltrate
• Move Through Cover
• Acute Senses
• Sabotage
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Falcon's Claws for +22 points per model.
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ................................. +2 points per model
• Cameleoline ................................... +5 points per model
• Any model may replace its M.40 Stalker Bolter with:
• Astartes Shotgun .............................. Free
• Sniper Rifle .................................. +5 points
• One Falcon's Claw may carry:
• Nuncio Vox .................................... +10 points
FALCON'S CLAW LEADER
The Falcon's Claw Leader may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-3-falcons-claws-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-3-falcons-claws-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="22" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-v-3-falcons-claws-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +22 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-3-falcons-claws-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades (base unit; +2 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-3-falcons-claws-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-3-falcons-claws-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-v-3-falcons-claws-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r41-unit-v-3-falcons-claws-opt-0-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +2 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit 