:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-4-qin-xa-master-of-the-keshig-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Qin Xa" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-4-qin-xa-master-of-the-keshig-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-v-4-qin-xa-master-of-the-keshig-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Qin Xa | 6 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 4 | 10 | 2+/4+
THE TAILS OF THE DRAGON The Tails of the Dragon are a pair of Power Weapons. The bonus Attack for fighting with two close-combat weapons is already included in Qin Xa's profile. At the beginning of each Assault phase, Qin Xa may use one of the following forms: Swift Form — attacks are resolved at +1 Strength. Sundering Form — attacks are resolved at +3 Strength and have the Unwieldy special rule. MASTER OF THE KESHIG Qin Xa may select one Ebon Keshig squad or Legion Terminator Command Squad as his retinue. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot and Qin Xa and his retinue count as a single HQ selection.
Unit Composition:
• 1 Qin Xa
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Tartaros Terminator Armour
• Iron Halo
• The Tails of the Dragon
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (White Scars)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Fearless
• Master of the Keshig</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="TARGUTAI YESUGEI" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="195" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-v" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Targutai Yesugei" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Targutai Yesugei | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
Unit Composition:• 1 Targutai Yesugei
CHIEF STORMSEER Yesugei knows the Unseen Bolt psychic power. In addition, he may select one psychic power from the normal Psychic Powers list. Yesugei otherwise follows all normal ProHammer rules for Psykers and Mastery Level 2.
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Force Weapon
• Psychic Hood
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (White Scars)
• Independent Character
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Adamantium Will
• Legion Support Officer
• Chief Stormseer
OPTIONS
• Yesugei may take:
• Krak grenades ................................. +2 points</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-v-5-targutai-yesugei-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Yesugei may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="SHIBAN KHAN" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="155" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-v" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Shiban Khan" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Shiban Khan | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
Unit Composition:
• 1 Shiban Khan
BROTHERHOOD OF THE STORM Shiban Khan has Fleet. Any White Scars unit Shiban has joined also gains Fleet while he remains part of the unit. COMMAND RETINUE Shiban Khan may select one Legion Command Squad as his retinue. If Shiban is mounted on a Bike or Jetbike, every model in the Command Squad may purchase a Space Marine Bike for +20 points per model. The Command Squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Power Weapon
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (White Scars)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Brotherhood of the Storm
OPTIONS
• Shiban Khan may take:
• Krak grenades ................................. +2 points
• Melta bombs .................................. +5 points
• Space Marine Bike ............................ +35 points
• If mounted on a Space Marine Bike, it may be upgraded to a
Jetbike for a further +5 points.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Shiban Khan may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Melta bombs" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-opt-1-melta-bombs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-opt-1-melta-bombs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Shiban Khan may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Space Marine Bike" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-opt-2-space-marine-bike"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-6-shiban-khan-opt-2-space-marine-bike-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost