><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/4+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Hibou Khan | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 3+/4+
Unit Composition:
• 1 Hibou Khan
BREATH OF THE STORM Breath of the Storm is a Master-crafted Power Weapon. During an Assault phase in which Hibou Khan charged, attacks made with Breath of the Storm are resolved at +2 Strength. During any other Assault phase they are resolved at +1 Strength. THE SEEKER OF ATONEMENT If Hibou Khan and his unit win a close combat and at least one enemy unit is destroyed or Retreats as a result, Hibou Khan and his unit gain Fearless until the end of the following White Scars player turn. COMMAND RETINUE Hibou Khan may select one Legion Command Squad or Legion Veteran Squad as his retinue. If Hibou Khan is mounted on a Bike or Jetbike, every model in the retinue may purchase a Space Marine Bike for +20 points per model. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Iron Halo
• Breath of the Storm
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (White Scars)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• The Seeker of Atonement
OPTIONS
• Hibou Khan may take:
• Krak grenades ................................. +2 points
• Space Marine Bike ............................ +35 points
• If mounted on a Space Marine Bike, it may be upgraded to a
Jetbike for a further +5 points.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Hibou Khan may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Space Marine Bike" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-opt-1-space-marine-bike"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-opt-1-space-marine-bike-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="35" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Hibou Khan may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Jetbike for a further" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-opt-2-jetbike-for-a-further"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-v-7-hibou-khan-opt-2-jetbike-for-a-further-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints>