Stalker Huscarl | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Troops
Unit Composition:
• 4 Grey Stalkers
• 1 Stalker Huscarl
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Stalker Huscarl is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolter
• Close-combat weapon
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Space Wolves)
• Infiltrate
• Move Through Cover
• Night Vision
OPTIONS
• The pack may include up to ten additional Grey Stalkers
for +17 points per model.
• For every five models in the pack, one Grey Stalker may replace his Bolter with:
• Flamer ......................................... +5 points
• Meltagun ...................................... +10 points
• Plasma Gun .................................... +15 points
• Volkite Charger ............................... +10 points
• One model may carry:
• Legion Vexilla ............................... +10 points
• One other model may carry:
• Nuncio Vox ................................... +10 points
• The entire pack may take:
• Frag grenades ............................ +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
STALKER HUSCARL
The Stalker Huscarl may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury and Space Wolves Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A pack of ten models or fewer may select a Rhino, Drop Pod or Dreadclaw Drop Pod. A Grey Stalker Pack embarked upon a Transport may only use Infiltrate if that Transport is itself permitted to deploy using Infiltrate</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-1-grey-stalker-pack-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-vi-1-grey-stalker-pack-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="10" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="17" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-vi-1-grey-stalker-pack-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 10 additional models at +17 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-1-grey-stalker-pack-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="for" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-1-grey-stalker-pack-opt-0-for"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-vi-1-grey-stalker-pack-opt-0-for-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="17" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-vi-1-grey-stalker-pack-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The pack may include up to ten additional Grey Stalkers</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Flamer" hidden="false" id=