s this option at +2 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="VARAGYR WOLF GUARD TERMINATORS" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="250" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-cat" name="Elites" hidden="false" targetId="cat-elites" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-vi" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Varagyr Terminator" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile><ns0:profile name="Varagyr Thegn" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-profile-1"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Varagyr Terminator | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 2+/4+
Varagyr Thegn | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
GLORY SEEKERS At the beginning of each Assault phase, if the Varagyr are engaged with one or more enemy Independent Characters, nominate one such character. Any Varagyr able to direct attacks against that character must do so. Each Varagyr attacking the nominated character may re-roll one failed To Hit roll during that Assault phase. CHOSEN OF THE JARL A Space Wolves Praetor equipped with Terminator Armour may select one Varagyr Wolf Guard Terminator Pack instead of a Legion Terminator Command Squad. The Varagyr do not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot and the Praetor and Varagyr count as a single HQ selection.
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 5 Varagyr Terminators
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• A Varagyr Thegn is a Character
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Combi-bolter
• Frost Blade or Frost Axe
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Space Wolves)
• Fearless
• Glory Seekers
• Chosen of the Jarl
OPTIONS
• The pack may include up to five additional Varagyr Terminators for +45 points per model.
• Any model may replace its Combi-bolter with:
• Foeblaster Boltgun ............................ +5 points
• Combi-flamer ................................. +10 points
• Combi-volkite charger ....................... +10 points
• Combi-meltagun .............................. +15 points
• Combi-plasma gun ............................ +15 points
• Any model may replace its Frost Blade or Frost Axe with:
• Power fist .................................... +5 points
• Chainfist .................................... +10 points
• Thunder hammer ............................... +10 points
• For every five models in the pack, one Varagyr may replace
his Combi-bolter with:
• Heavy flamer ................................. +10 points
• Reaper autocannon ............................ +15 points
• Assault cannon ............................... +20 points
• One Varagyr may be upgraded to:
• Varagyr Thegn ................................ +25 points
• The Varagyr Thegn may take:
• Grenade Harness .............................. +10 points
The Varagyr Thegn may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury and Space Wolves Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The pack may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Spartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="45" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +45 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Foeblaster Boltgun" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-opt-0-foeblaster-boltgun"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-opt-0-foeblaster-boltgun-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="10" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-vi-5-varagyr-wolf-guard-terminators-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Any model may replace its Combi-bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Combi-fl