Special Rules:
• Old and Wise
• Hard to Kill</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="OHTHERE WYRDMAKE" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-10-ohthere-wyrdmake"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="150" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-vi-10-ohthere-wyrdmake-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-vi" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-vi-10-ohthere-wyrdmake-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Ohthere Wyrdmake" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vi-10-ohthere-wyrdmake-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-vi-10-ohthere-wyrdmake-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Ohthere Wyrdmake | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+
Force Organisation:
COMMAND RETINUE Ohthere may select a Legion Command Squad as his retinue. RUNIC STAFF Ohthere's Runic Staff counts as both a Force Weapon and a Psychic Hood. LIVING LIGHTNING Living Lightning is a Witchfire psychic power used during the Shooting phase. If successfully invoked, resolve it using the profile below. Psychic Attack Range S AP Type Living Lightning 24" 5 4 Assault D6
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Runic Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Runic Staff
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Space Wolves)
• Independent Character
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Legion Support Officer
Psychic Powers:
• Mystic Winds of Fenris
