Huscarl Captain | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
RETINUE One Huscarl Terminator Retinue may be selected for Rogal Dorn, Sigismund or an Imperial Fists Praetor wearing Terminator Armour. The squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
Force Organisation:
• Retinue
Unit Composition:
• 4 Huscarls
• 1 Huscarl Captain
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Huscarl Captain is a Character
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Combi-bolter
• Power weapon
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Imperial Fists)
• Stubborn
• Retinue
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Huscarls for +50 points per model.
• Any Huscarl may replace his Combi-bolter with:
• Foeblaster boltgun ............................... +5 points
• Combi-flamer .................................... +10 points
• Combi-volkite charger .......................... +10 points
• Combi-meltagun ................................. +15 points
• Combi-plasma gun ............................... +15 points
• Any Huscarl may replace his Power weapon with:
• Power fist ....................................... +10 points
• Lightning claw ................................... +10 points
• Chainfist ......................................... +15 points
• Thunder hammer .................................. +15 points
• One model may take:
• Grenade Harness ................................ +10 points
HUSCARL CAPTAIN
The Huscarl Captain may select up to 50 points of permitted Terminator weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vii-2-huscarl-terminator-retinue-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-vii-2-huscarl-terminator-retinue-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="50" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-vii-2-huscarl-terminator-retinue-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +50 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vii-2-huscarl-terminator-retinue-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Foeblaster boltgun" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-vii-2-huscarl-terminator-retinue-opt-0-foeblaster-boltgun"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-vii-2-huscarl-terminator-retinue-opt-0-foeblaster-boltgun-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-vii-2-huscarl-terminator-retinue-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Any Huscarl may replace his Combi-bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Combi-flamer" hidd