n-the-praetorian-of-terra-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Primarch of the Imperial Fists, Praetorian of Terra, the Unyielding One
Rogal Dorn was the stern and uncompromising master of the VII Legion, a warrior whose name became synonymous with duty, endurance and the art of fortification. Where others sought victory through speed, deception or fury, Dorn imposed his will upon the battlefield through preparation, discipline and an absolute refusal to yield what had been entrusted to him.
Whether raising defences against impossible odds or personally leading an assault upon an enemy stronghold, Dorn possessed a rare understanding of war as both construction and destruction. Under his command, a ruined wall became a fortress, a battered line became immovable, and the warriors of the Imperial Fists would stand their ground long after lesser forces had broken.
Rogal Dorn | 7 | 6 | 6 | 6 | 6 | 6 | 5 | 10 | 1+
