Force Organisation:
• Elites
TELEPORT ASSAULT An Atramentar Flay-Clade may deploy using Deep Strike evenif the mission being played does not normally permit Deep Strike. All other normal ProHammer Deep Strike rules apply.
Unit Composition:
• 5 Atramentar
Unit Type:
• Infantry
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Trophies of Judgement
• Combi-bolter
• Power weapon
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Night Lords)
• Fearless
• Teleport Assault
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Atramentar for +50 points per model.
• Any model may replace his Combi-bolter with:
• Storm bolter .................................... Free
• Foeblaster Boltgun ............................ +5 points
• Combi-flamer .................................. +10 points
• Combi-volkite charger ........................ +10 points
• Combi-meltagun ............................... +15 points
• Combi-plasma gun ............................. +15 points
• Any model may replace his Power weapon with:
• Power fist ..................................... +5 points
• Lightning claw ................................ +5 points
• Chainfist ..................................... +10 points
• Thunder hammer ............................... +10 points
• Any model may replace both his Combi-bolter and Power weapon with:
• Pair of Lightning Claws ...................... +15 points
• For every five models, one Atramentar may replace his Combi-bolter with:
• Heavy Flamer ................................. +10 points
• Reaper Autocannon ............................ +15 points
• Plasma Blaster ............................... +15 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod orSpartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="50" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +50 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Storm bolter" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-0-storm-bolter"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-0-storm-bolter-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="10" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Any model may replace his Combi-bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Foeblaster Boltgun" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clad