></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Reaper Autocannon" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-12-reaper-autocannon"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-12-reaper-autocannon-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-12-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models, one Atramentar may replace his Combi-bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Plasma Blaster" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-13-plasma-blaster"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-13-plasma-blaster-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-viii-3-atramentar-flay-clade-opt-13-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models, one Atramentar may replace his Combi-bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="JAGO SEVATARION" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-viii-4-jago-sevatarion"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="200" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-viii-4-jago-sevatarion-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-viii" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-viii-4-jago-sevatarion-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Sevatar" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-viii-4-jago-sevatarion-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">7</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-viii-4-jago-sevatarion-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Sevatar | 7 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 4 | 10 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
NIGHT'S WHISPER Night's Whisper is a Two-Handed, Master-crafted Power Weapon.Attacks made with Night's Whisper are resolved at Strength 6. VISIONS OF DOOM Sevatar knows only the Withering Gaze psychic power.When making the Psychic Test required to invoke Withering Gaze,Sevatar uses Leadership 7 rather than his normal Leadership. WITHERING GAZE Withering Gaze is used during the Night Lords Shooting phase instead of Sevatar firing a weapon. Choose one visible enemy unit within 12" and take a Psychic Test.If successful, until the beginning of the next Night Lords turn, that enemy unit must pass a Leadership test before it may declare a charge against Sevatar or a unit he has joined. If the test is failed, the unit may not declare that charge during that Assault phase, but may declare a charge against another eligible target. COMMAND RETINUE Sevatar may select one Legion Command Squad, Legion TerminatorCommand Squad or Atramentar Flay-Clade as his retinue.The selected unit does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
• HQ
