" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Erelim | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 9 | 3+
Arch-Erelim | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
DUAL PISTOLS A model with this rule may fire both of its Pistol weapons duringthe Shooting phase. Both pistols must fire at the same target. DESTROYER CADRE An Angel's Tears Squad may normally only be joined by a Moritat. Dominion Zephon is an exception to this rule. Weapon Range S AP Type Angel's Tears Grenade Launcher 24" 4 4 Assault 3, Fleshbane, Rad-phage
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Erelim
• 1 Arch-Erelim
Unit Type:
• Jump Infantry
• The Arch-Erelim is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Jump Pack
• Two Volkite Serpentas
• Chainsword
• Frag grenades
• Rad grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Blood Angels)
• Counter-Attack
• Dual Pistols
• Destroyer Cadre
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Erelim for +30 points per model.
• For every five models in the squad, one Erelim may replace one Volkite Serpenta with:
• Rotor Cannon ......................................... +5 points
• Heavy Flamer ........................................ +10 points
• Angel's Tears Grenade Launcher ...................... +15 points
• Assault Cannon with Suspensor Web ................... +25 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
ARCH-ERELIM
The Arch-Erelim may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon ....................................... +5 points
• Power weapon ........................................ +10 points
• Power fist .......................................... +15 points
The Arch-Erelim may select up to 50 points of permitted weaponsand wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-2-angel-s-tears-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-ix-2-angel-s-tears-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="30" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-ix-2-angel-s-tears-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +30 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-2-angel-s-tears-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Rotor Cannon" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-2-angel-s-tears-squad-opt-0-rotor-cannon"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-ix-2-angel-s-tears-squad-opt-0-rotor-cannon-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-ix-2-angel-s-tears-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models in the squad, one Erelim may replace one Volkite Serpenta with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Heavy Flamer" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-2-angel-s-tears-squad-op