Force Organisation:
SPIRITUM SANGUIS Spiritum Sanguis is a Two-Handed, Master-crafted Power Weapon. Attacks made with it are resolved at +1 Strength. If Zephon begins an Assault phase in base contact with two or more enemy models, he receives +1 Attack for that Assault phase. LAMENT AND GRIEF Lament and Greif both are Volkite Serpentas DUAL PISTOLS Zephon may fire both Lament and Grief during the Shooting phase. Both weapons must fire at the same target. EXARCH OF THE HIGH HOST Zephon may join an Angel's Tears Squad or Legion Destroyer Squad despite the normal restrictions of Destroyer Cadre. He may select one Angel's Tears Squad as his retinue. The squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
