• Melta bombs .......................................... +5 points</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-10-nassir-amit-the-flesh-tearer-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-10-nassir-amit-the-flesh-tearer-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-ix-10-nassir-amit-the-flesh-tearer-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-ix-10-nassir-amit-the-flesh-tearer-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Nassir Amit may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Melta bombs" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-10-nassir-amit-the-flesh-tearer-opt-1-melta-bombs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-ix-10-nassir-amit-the-flesh-tearer-opt-1-melta-bombs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-ix-10-nassir-amit-the-flesh-tearer-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Nassir Amit may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="IX — SANGUINIUS, THE GREAT ANGEL" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-11-ix-sanguinius-the-great-angel"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="510" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-ix-11-ix-sanguinius-the-great-angel-cat" name="Lords of War" hidden="false" targetId="cat-low" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-ix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="allegiance-loyalist" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-ix-11-ix-sanguinius-the-great-angel-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Sanguinius" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-ix-11-ix-sanguinius-the-great-angel-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">7</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">1+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-ix-11-ix-sanguinius-the-great-angel-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Primarch of the Blood Angels, the Great Angel, Lord of the IX Legion
Sanguinius was among the most beloved of the Emperor’s sons, a figure of terrible beauty whose nobility stood in stark contrast to the savage legacy carried within the blood of his Legion. Born beneath the irradiated skies of Baal and marked from his earliest days by the great wings that bore him aloft, Sanguinius possessed a presence capable of inspiring warriors and mortals alike to acts of extraordinary courage.
In war, the Great Angel was the embodiment of the IX Legion’s doctrine of sudden and overwhelming assault. Descending from the heavens at the head of his sons, Sanguinius struck with such speed and violence that enemy formations could collapse before they had time to respond. Yet beneath his splendour lay the fury of Baal, and once committed to battle the Angel could become one of the most fearsome warriors among all the Primarchs.
Sanguinius | 9 | 6 | 6 | 6 | 6 | 7 | 6 | 10 | 1+
Force Organisation:
• Lord of War
Unit Composition:
• 1 Sanguinius
Unit Type:
• Jump Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Regalia Resplendent
• Blade Encarmine or Spear of Telesto
• Infernus
• Great Wings
• Frag Grenades
Special Rules:
• Primarch
• Legiones Astartes (Blood Angels)
• Angelic Charge
• Sire of the Blood Angels
• The Angel Descends
RESTRICTIONS
Sanguinius may only be selected for a Loyalist Blood Angels army. He otherwise follows all normal rules and restrictions for Primarchs.
REGALIA RESPLENDENT A magnificent suit of artificer-wrought plate fashioned to protect the Great Angel without impeding his extraordinary speed, the Regalia Resplendent was as much a symbol of Sanguinius’ majesty as it was a weapon of war. The Regalia Resplendent counts as Primarch Armour. BLADE ENCARMINE An exquisite weapon crafted for the hand of the Great Angel, the Blade Encarmine combined perfect balance with killing power worthy of a Primarch. The Blade Encarmine is a Master-crafted Power Weapon. Attacks made with it are resolved at +1 Strength and have the Shred and Rampage special rules. SPEAR OF TELESTO An ancient and magnificent weapon carried by Sanguinius throughout the Great Crusade and Horus Heresy, the Spear of Telesto was capable of driving through the strongest armour beneath the strength of the Angel’s charge. The Spear of Telesto is a Master-crafted, Two-Handed Power Weapon. Attacks made with it are resolved at +3 Strength and have the Lance special rule. INFERNUS A potent relic weapon carried by Sanguinius, Infernus discharged blasts of destructive energy capable of reducing even heavily armoured targets to molten ruin. Weapon Range S AP Type Infernus 18" 8 1 Assault 2, Melta, One Use GREAT WINGS The great pinions borne by Sanguinius were no mechanical device, but a natural part of the Primarch himself, capable of carrying the Angel through the skies with astonishing speed. Sanguinius is treated as Jump Infantry and follows all normal ProHammer rules for Jump Infantry. His ability to move as Jump Infantry may never be lost, disabled or destroyed as the result of damage to wargear. ANGELIC CHARGE Few sights inspired greater awe or terror than the Great Angel descending upon his enemies with weapon raised and wings spread wide. During an Assault phase in which Sanguinius charged, increase his Strength and Attacks characteristics by +1 for that Assault phase. SIRE OF THE BLOOD ANGELS The sons of the IX Legion fought with renewed courage beneath the gaze of their gene-sire, striving to prove themselves worthy of the Angel whose blood they carried. Friendly Blood Angels units with at least one model within 12" of Sanguinius may re-roll failed Morale and Pinning tests. The second result must be accepted. THE ANGEL DESCENDS Sanguinius descended upon the battlefield with supernatural precision, falling from the heavens directly into the heart of the enemy before they could react. When Sanguinius enters play using Deep Strike, he does not scatter. If Sanguinius declares a charge during the same turn in which he arrived using Deep Strike, he receives the normal +1 Attack bonus for charging and the normal benefits of any Assault Grenades he carries. This specifically overrides the normal ProHammer restrictions on charging after Deep Strike. PRIMARCH RETINUE Sanguinius may select any one of the following as his Primarch Retinue: • Legion Honour Guard Squad • Sanguinary Guard Squad A retinue selected in this manner does not occupy an additional Force Organisation selection and otherwise follows the normal Primarch Retinue rules. A Legion Honour Guard Squad selected as Sanguinius’ Primarch Retinue may equip every model in the squad with a Jump Pack for +10 points per model. Every model in the squad must take this upgrade.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="MEDUSAN IMMORTAL SQUAD" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="150" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-cat" name="Troops" hidden="false" targetId="cat-troops" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-x" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Medusan Immortal" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile><ns0:profile name="Immortal Sergeant" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-profile-1"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Medusan Immortal | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 9 | 3+/5+
Immortal Sergeant | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
• Troops
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 4 Medusan Immortals
• 1 Immortal Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Immortal Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolter
• Boarding Shield
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Iron Hands)
• Stubborn
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to fifteen additional Medusan Immortals for +27 points per model.
• For every five models in the squad, one Medusan Immortal may
replace his Bolter with:
• Flamer .......................................... +5 points
• Meltagun ....................................... +10 points
• Plasma Gun ..................................... +15 points
• Graviton Gun ................................... +15 points
• One model may carry:
• Legion Vexilla ................................. +10 points
• One different model may carry:
• Nuncio Vox ..................................... +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades .............................. +1 point per model
• Krak grenades .............................. +2 points per model
IMMORTAL SERGEANT
The Immortal Sergeant may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad of ten models or fewer may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Flamer" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-opt-0-flamer"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-opt-0-flamer-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>replace his Bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Meltagun" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-opt-1-meltagun"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-opt-1-meltagun-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>replace his Bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Plasma Gun" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-opt-2-plasma-gun"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-x-0-medusan-immortal-squad-opt-2-plasma-gun-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value=