Morlock Captain | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 3 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
MORLOCKS OF THE AVERNII Ferrus Manus or Gabriel Santar may select one Morlock Terminator Squad as a retinue. If selected in this manner, the Morlocks do not occupy a separate Elites choice.
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 4 Morlock Terminators
• 1 Morlock Captain
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Morlock Captain is a Character
Wargear — Morlocks:
• Gorgon-pattern Terminator Armour
• Bionics
• Storm bolter
• Power weapon
Wargear — Morlock Captain:
• Gorgon-pattern Terminator Armour
• Bionics
• Storm bolter
• Thunder hammer
• Iron Halo
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Iron Hands)
• Fearless
• Gorgon Field
• Morlocks of the Avernii
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Morlocks for +50 points per model.
• Any Morlock may replace his Storm bolter with:
• Foeblaster Boltgun .............................. Free
• Combi-flamer .................................. +10 points
• Combi-volkite charger ........................ +10 points
• Combi-meltagun ............................... +15 points
• Combi-plasma gun ............................. +15 points
• Any Morlock may replace his Power weapon with:
• Power fist ...................................... +5 points
• Lightning claw ................................. +5 points
• Chainfist ...................................... +10 points
• Thunder hammer ................................ +10 points
• Up to two Morlocks may replace their Storm bolter with:
• Heavy Flamer .................................. +10 points
• Plasma Blaster ................................ +15 points
• Plasma Cannon ................................. +20 points
• The Morlock Captain may take:
• Grenade Harness ............................... +10 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Spartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-2-morlock-terminator-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-x-2-morlock-terminator-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="50" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-x-2-morlock-terminator-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +50 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-2-morlock-terminator-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Foeblaster Boltgun" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-2-morlock-terminator-squad-opt-0-foeblaster-boltgun"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-x-2-morlock-terminator-squad-opt-0-foeblaster-boltgun-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-x-2-morlock-terminator-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Any Morlock may replace his Storm bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Combi-flamer" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-2-morlock-t