istic name="BS" typeId="walker-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="walker-s">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Front" typeId="walker-front">12</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Side" typeId="walker-side">12</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Rear" typeId="walker-rear">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="walker-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="walker-a">2</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Venerable Forge Lord | 5 | 5 | 6 | 12 | 12 | 10 | 4 | 2
Force Organisation:
PAIRED CLOSE-COMBAT ARMS If the Venerable Forge Lord retains both Dreadnought Close Combat Weapons, it gains +1 Attack. This bonus is not included in its profile. OLD &amp; WISE If the mission requires a dice roll to determine which player takes the first turn, an Iron Hands army containing a Venerable Forge Lord may re-roll that roll once. The second result must be accepted. HARD TO KILL Whenever the Venerable Forge Lord suffers a Glancing or Penetrating Hit and a result is rolled on the Vehicle Damage table, the Iron Hands player may force the opponent to re-roll that Vehicle Damage result. The second result must be accepted. AUTO-REPAIR SIMULACRA Whenever a Vehicle Damage result would destroy the Venerable Forge Lord, roll a D6 after resolving Hard to Kill. On a roll of 6, the Venerable Forge Lord is not destroyed. Replace the result with Crew Shaken.
• Elites
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 1 Venerable Forge Lord
Unit Type:
• Vehicle (Walker)
Wargear:
• Two Dreadnought Close Combat Weapons,
each with a built-in Twin-linked Bolter
• Smoke Launchers
• Searchlight
Special Rules:
• Old &amp; Wise
• Hard to Kill
• Auto-Repair Simulacra
OPTIONS
• Either Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon may be replaced with:
• Twin-linked Heavy Bolter ........................ Free
• Multi-Melta ..................................... Free
• Twin-linked Autocannon ......................... +10 points
• Twin-linked Missile Launcher ................... +15 points
• Plasma Cannon .................................. +10 points
• Volkite Culverin ............................... +10 points
• Assault Cannon ................................. +15 points
• Twin-linked Lascannon .......................... +25 points
• Any built-in Twin-linked Bolter may be replaced with:
• Heavy Flamer ................................... +10 points
• Meltagun ....................................... +15 points
• Graviton Gun ................................... +15 points
• The Venerable Forge Lord may take:
• Extra Armour .................................... +5 points</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Twin-linked Heavy Bolter" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-opt-0-twin-linked-heavy-bolter"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-opt-0-twin-linked-heavy-bolter-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Either Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon may be replaced with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Multi-Melta" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-opt-1-multi-melta"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-opt-1-multi-melta-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Either Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon may be replaced with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Twin-linked Autocannon" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-x-3-venerable-forge-lord-opt-2-twin-linked-autocannon"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-x-3-venera