files><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Red Butcher | 3 | 2 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 9 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
RAVENING MADMEN Red Butchers always hit models with a Weapon Skill on a 3+ in close combat, regardless of the normal Weapon Skill comparison. Enemy models likewise always hit Red Butchers on a 3+. This does not affect attacks made against Vehicles or other targets without a Weapon Skill and does not override a rule which allows a model to hit on a better fixed result. Red Butchers never count as a Scoring Unit.
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 5 Red Butchers
Unit Type:
• Infantry
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Two Power weapons
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)
• Fearless
• Ravening Madmen
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Red Butchers for +60 points per model.
• Any Red Butcher may replace one Power weapon with:
• Power fist ....................................... +5 points
• Chainfist ....................................... +10 points
• Thunder hammer ................................. +10 points
The Attacks characteristic shown in the profile already includes the bonus Attack for fighting with two close-combat weapons.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Spartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="60" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +60 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Power fist" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-opt-0-power-fist"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-opt-0-power-fist-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Any Red Butcher may replace one Power weapon with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Chainfist" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-1-red-butcher-squad-opt-1-chainfist"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint