Red Hand Sergeant | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Red Hand Destroyers
• 1 Red Hand Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Red Hand Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Two Bolt pistols
• Chainaxe
• Frag grenades
• Rad grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)
• Counter-Attack
• Dual Pistols
• Destroyer Cadre
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Red Hand Destroyers for +22 points per model.
• For every five models, one Red Hand Destroyer may replace one Bolt pistol with:
• Volkite serpenta ................................. +5 points
• Hand flamer ...................................... +5 points
• Plasma pistol ................................... +15 points
• Missile launcher with Suspensor Web
and Rad Missiles ................................ +25 points
• For every five models, one Red Hand Destroyer may take:
• One Phosphex Bomb .............................. +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
RED HAND SERGEANT
The Red Hand Sergeant may replace his Chainaxe with:
• Rending Weapon .................................... +5 points
• Power weapon ..................................... +10 points
• Power fist ....................................... +15 points
• Lightning claw ................................... +15 points
• Thunder hammer ................................... +20 points
The Red Hand Sergeant may take:
• Artificer Armour ................................. +10 points
• Up to three Phosphex Bombs ...................... +10 points each
ASSAULT SQUAD
The entire squad may take Jump Packs for +15 points per model.
If it does so:
• The unit becomes Jump Infantry.
• It is renamed a Red Hand Destroyer Assault Squad.
• It may not select a Dedicated Transport.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A Mortalis Squad may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Podor Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-2-red-hand-destroyer-mortalis-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xii-2-red-hand-destroyer-mortalis-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="22" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xii-2-red-hand-destroyer-mortalis-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +22 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-2-red-hand-destroyer-mortalis-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Volkite serpenta" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-2-red-hand-destroyer-mortalis-squad-opt-0-volkite-serpenta"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xii-2-red-hand-destroyer-mortalis-squad-opt-0-volkite-serpenta-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xii-2-red-hand-destroyer-mortalis-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models, one Red Hand Destroyer may replace one Bolt pistol with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0: