Devourer Chieftain | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
DEVOURERS Angron may select one Devourer Terminator Squad as his retinue. If selected in this manner, the Devourers do not occupy a separate Elites choice.
Unit Composition:
• 4 Devourers
• 1 Devourer Chieftain
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Devourer Chieftain is a Character
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Combi-bolter
• Power weapon
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)
• Stubborn
• Devourers
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Devourers for +45 points per model.
• Any model may replace his Combi-bolter with:
• Foeblaster Boltgun .............................. +5 points
• Combi-flamer ................................... +10 points
• Combi-volkite charger ......................... +10 points
• Combi-meltagun ................................ +15 points
• Combi-plasma gun .............................. +15 points
• Any model may replace his Power weapon with:
• Power fist ....................................... +5 points
• Lightning claw .................................. +5 points
• Chainfist ....................................... +10 points
• Thunder hammer ................................. +10 points
• One model may take:
• Grenade Harness ................................ +10 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
