Trarii Breacher Champion | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Trarii Breacher
• 1 Trarii Breacher Champion
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Rampager Champion is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Chainaxe
• Boarding Shield
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Trarii Breacher for +27 points per model.
• All Trarii Breacher may replace their Chainaxe with:
• Caedere Weapon ................................. +5 points
• Power weapon ................................... +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ............................ +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
Trarii Breacher CHAMPION
TheTriarii Breacher Champion may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-5-triarii-breacher-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xii-5-triarii-breacher-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="27" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xii-5-triarii-breacher-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +27 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-5-triarii-breacher-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Caedere Weapon" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-5-triarii-breacher-squad-opt-0-caedere-weapon"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xii-5-triarii-breacher-squad-opt-0-caedere-weapon-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xii-5-triarii-breacher-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• All Trarii Breacher may replace their Chainaxe with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Power weapon" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-5-triarii-breacher-squ