Force Organisation:
• HQ
MASTER OF DESTROYERS Shabran Darr may join Legion Destroyer Squads and Red Hand Destroyer Squads despite the normal restrictions imposed by Destroyer Cadre. Darr may select one Red Hand Destroyer Mortalis or Assault Squad as his retinue. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Two Bolt pistols
• Power Weapon
• Frag grenades
• Rad grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)
• Independent Character
• Stubborn
• Dual Pistols
• Master of Destroyers
Allegiance:
• Loyalist only
OPTIONS
• Shabran Darr may take:
• Krak grenades ..................................... +2 points
• Melta bombs ...................................... +5 points</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-7-shabran-darr-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-7-shabran-darr-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xii-7-shabran-darr-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xii-7-shabran-darr-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Shabran Darr may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Melta bombs" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-7-shabran-darr-opt-1-melta-bombs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xii-7-shabran-darr-opt-1-melta-bombs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xii-7-shabran-darr-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Shabran Darr may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="GAhLAN SURLAK" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xii-8-gahlan-surlak"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="125" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xii-8-gahlan-surlak-cat" name="