| 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 2+
Locutarus Strike Leader | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 3 | 9 | 2+
Force Organisation:
ARGEAN POWER SWORD An Argean Power Sword is a Master-crafted Power Weapon. COORDINATED ASSAULT If the Locutarus charge an enemy unit which suffered one or more hits from another friendly Ultramarines unit during the preceding Shooting phase, the Locutarus may re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 during that Assault phase.
• Fast Attack
Unit Composition:
• 4 Locutarus
• 1 Locutarus Strike Leader
Unit Type:
• Jump Infantry
• The Locutarus Strike Leader is a Character
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Jump Pack
• Bolt pistol
• Argean Power Sword
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Ultramarines)
• Coordinated Assault
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Locutarus for +35 points per model.
• Up to two Locutarus may replace their Bolt pistol with:
• Hand Flamer ....................................... +5 points
• Plasma pistol .................................... +15 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
LOCUTARUS STRIKE LEADER
The Strike Leader may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-2-locutarus-storm-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xiii-2-locutarus-storm-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="35" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xiii-2-locutarus-storm-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +35 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-2-locutarus-storm-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Hand Flamer" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-2-locutarus-storm-squad-opt-0-hand-flamer"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xiii-2-locutarus-storm-squad-opt-0-hand-flamer-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xiii-2-locutarus-storm-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Up to two Locutarus may replace their Bolt pistol with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Plasma pistol" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-2-locutarus-storm-squad