Nemesis Destroyer Sergeant | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
MORTIFIER BOLTER Mortifier bolter are normal Bolters that have the Poisoned (3+) and Pinning Special Rules
• 4 Nemesis Destroyers
• 1 Nemesis Destroyer Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Nemesis Destroyer Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Mortifier Bolter
• Bolt pistol
• Chainsword
• Rad grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Ultramarines)
• Counter-Attack
• Stubborn
• Destroyer Cadre
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Nemesis Destroyers for +25 points per model.
• For every five models in the squad, one Nemesis Destroyer may replace his Mortifier Bolter with:
• Heavy Flamer .................................... +10 points
• Missile Launcher with Suspensor Web
and Rad Missiles ................................ +25 points
• One model may carry:
• Legion Vexilla .................................. +10 points
• One different model may carry:
• Nuncio Vox ...................................... +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ............................ +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
• Melta bombs ............................. +5 points per model
NEMESIS DESTROYER SERGEANT
The Sergeant may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon .................................... +5 points
• Power weapon ..................................... +10 points
• Power fist ....................................... +15 points
• Thunder hammer ................................... +20 points
The Sergeant may take:
• Artificer Armour ................................. +10 points
• Up to three Phosphex Bombs ...................... +10 points each
The Sergeant may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +25 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Heavy Flamer" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-opt-0-heavy-flamer"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-opt-0-heavy-flamer-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xiii-3-nemesis-destroyer-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models in the squad, one Nemesis Destroyer may replace his Mortifier Bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="and Rad Missi