ule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="CASTELLAX-ACHEA MANIPLE" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="130" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-cat" name="Elites" hidden="false" targetId="cat-elites" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xv" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Castellax-Achea" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">8</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Castellax-Achea | 3 | 3 | 5 | 6 | 3 | 3 | 2 | 8 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 1 Castellax-Achea
Unit Type:
• Monstrous Creature
Wargear:
• Two Dreadnought Close Combat Weapons
• Twin-linked Bolter
• Æther-fire Cannon
Special Rules:
• Fearless
• Aetheric Command Matrix
• Psychic Conduit
• Aetheric Shielding
• Thousand Sons Construct
OPTIONS
• The Maniple may include up to two additional Castellax-Achea for +130 points per model.
• Any Castellax-Achea may replace its Twin-linked Bolter with:
• Heavy Flamer ................................. +5 points
AETHERIC COMMAND MATRIX At the beginning of each Thousand Sons Movement phase, determine whether at least one model in the Maniple is within 12" of a friendly Thousand Sons Psyker. If so, the Maniple acts normally until the beginning of the next Thousand Sons Movement phase. If no friendly Thousand Sons Psyker is within 12", the Maniple must take a Leadership test. If the test is failed: • The Maniple may not Advance. • The Maniple may not charge. • If it shoots, it must target the nearest visible eligible enemy unit. PSYCHIC CONDUIT Once during each Thousand Sons Shooting phase, one friendly Thousand Sons Psyker within 12" of the Maniple may channel one psychic shooting power through one Castellax-Achea. Measure range and line of sight from the selected Castellax-Achea rather than from the Psyker. The Psyker takes the Psychic Test normally and the power counts towards the Psyker's normal psychic-power limit. The selected Castellax-Achea may not fire its Æther-fire Cannon during that Shooting phase. If the Psyker suffers Perils of the Warp while using Psychic Conduit, the selected Castellax-Achea also suffers one Wound. Its Invulnerable Save may be taken normally. AETHERIC SHIELDING The Castellax-Achea has a 5+ Invulnerable Save. This is already included in its profile. THOUSAND SONS CONSTRUCT A Castellax-Achea counts as a Thousand Sons unit for rules which specifically affect friendly Thousand Sons units. It does not possess the Legiones Astartes special rule and is not assigned to a Prosperine Cult.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="130" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 2 additional models at +130 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Heavy Flamer" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-opt-0-heavy-flamer"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-opt-0-heavy-flamer-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Any Castellax-Achea may replace its Twin-linked Bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="CONTEMPTOR-OSIRON DREADNOUGHT" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="225" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-cat" name="Elites" hidden="false" targetId="cat-elites" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xv" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Contemptor-Osiron" typeId="prof-walker" typeName="Walker" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="walker-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="walker-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="walker-s">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Front" typeId="walker-front">13</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Side" typeId="walker-side">12</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Rear" typeId="walker-rear">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="walker-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="walker-a">3</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Contemptor-Osiron | 5 | 5 | 6 | 13 | 12 | 10 | 4 | 3
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 1 Contemptor-Osiron
Unit Type:
• Vehicle (Walker)
Wargear:
• Osiron Force Blade with built-in Twin-linked Bolter
• Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon
• Smoke Launchers
• Searchlight
Special Rules:
• Atomantic Shielding
• Fleet
• Psyker (Mastery Level 1\)
• Psychic Dreadnought
• Aetheric Battle-Engine
OPTIONS
• The Osiron may be upgraded to:
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\) ..................... +25 points
If upgraded to Mastery Level 2, it selects one additional psychic power.
• The Twin-linked Bolter built into the Osiron Force Blade
may be replaced with:
• Heavy Flamer ................................. +10 points
• Graviton Gun ................................. +15 points
• Meltagun ..................................... +15 points
• The Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon may be replaced with:
• Twin-linked Heavy Bolter ........................ Free
• Multi-Melta ..................................... Free
• Twin-linked Autocannon ....................... +10 points
• Plasma Cannon ................................ +10 points
• Twin-linked Volkite Culverin ................. +15 points
• Kheres Assault Cannon ........................ +15 points
• Twin-linked Lascannon ........................ +25 points
• The Osiron may take:
• Extra Armour ................................... +5 points
PSYCHIC DREADNOUGHT The Osiron selects one psychic power from: • Biomancy • Divination • Pyromancy • Telekinesis • Telepathy It takes Psychic Tests using Leadership 9. If upgraded to Mastery Level 2, it selects a second power from the same list. If the Osiron suffers Perils of the Warp, it suffers one automatic Glancing Hit. Automatic Shielding may not prevent this hit. The Osiron is not assigned to a Prosperine Cult. AETHERIC BATTLE-ENGINE The Osiron may invoke psychic powers during a player turn in which it also fires its weapons. A psychic shooting power may be resolved in addition to the Osiron's normal shooting attacks. No more than one psychic shooting power may be used in addition to its normal weapons during the same Shooting phase. Unless another rule permits otherwise, all shooting attacks made by the Osiron during that Shooting phase must target the same enemy unit. OSIRON FORCE BLADE The Osiron Force Blade counts as both a Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon and a Force Weapon. Force Weapon activation does not count as invoking a psychic power.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-opt-0-psyker-mastery-level-2"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-opt-0-psyker-mastery-level-2-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The Osiron may be upgrad