THE LAST WOLF The first time Loken is reduced to 0 Wounds, place a marker a his final position and remove his model. This rule may not be used if the attack which removed Loken's final Wound inflicted a Massive Wound. At the beginning of the next Sons of Horus turn, roll a D6. 3+: Return Loken to play with 1 Wound remaining at the position marked, or as close as legally possible. 1–2: Loken remains a casualty. This rule may only be used once per battle. COMMAND RETINUE Loken may select: • one Legion Command Squad; or • one Legion Veteran Squad as his retinue. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
