st" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvi-7-maloghurst-the-twisted-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvi-7-maloghurst-the-twisted-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Maloghurst is not a separate HQ selection.
Maloghurst | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+/5+
One Legion Command Squad containing a Standard Bearer may replace that model with Maloghurst the Twisted. Maloghurst has a total cost of 65 points. Do not also pay the normal cost of the Standard Bearer or Legion Standard.
Maloghurst:
BANNER OF THE WARMASTER The Banner of the Warmaster counts as a Legion Standard. Maloghurst therefore counts as the squad's Standard Bearer. BROKEN BODY Reduce the following movement made by Maloghurst's unit by 1", to a minimum of 1": • Normal Movement • Advance movement • Charge movement • Fall Back movement • Consolidation movement In addition, Maloghurst's unit may not Pursue a retreating enemy.
• remains permanently part of the Command Squad;
• is a Character;
• is not an Independent Character;
• occupies no separate Force Organisation selection.
