• Legion Overseer: Infantry (Character)
Wargear — Covenant Zealots:
• Autopistol
• Close combat weapon
• Flak armour
Wargear — Legion Overseer:
• Power armour
• Refractor field
• Bolt pistol
• Close combat weapon
• Frag grenades
• Krak grenades
Special Rules:
• Expendable
• Driven to Slaughter
