</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Possessed Marine | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 10 | 3+/5+
Possessed Champion | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 10 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
DAEMONKIN After deployment but before the first turn begins, roll a D6 for each Possessed Marine Squad. The entire squad gains the corresponding special rule for the duration of the battle: 1 — Scout 2 — Furious Charge 3 — Fleet 4 — Rending in close combat 5 — Feel No Pain (5+) 6 — Counter-Attack
• Elites
• 0–2
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
Unit Composition:
• 5 Possessed Marines
Unit Type:
• Infantry
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Close-combat weapon
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
• Daemon
• Fearless
• Daemonkin
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Possessed Marines for +26 points per model.
• One Possessed Marine may be upgraded to a Possessed Champion for +10 points.
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ............................ +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
POSSESSED CHAMPION
The Possessed Champion is a Character. The Possessed Champion may replace his Close-combat weapon with:
• Rending Weapon .................................. +5 points
• Power weapon ................................... +10 points
• Power fist ...................................... +15 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino or Dreadclaw Drop Pod where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="26" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +26 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Frag grenades (base unit; +1 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-opt-0-frag-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-opt-0-frag-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-opt-0-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +1 points 