Force Organisation:
CUSTODIAN SPEAR The Custodian Spear is a Two-Handed, Master-crafted Power Weapon with an inbuilt Foeblaster Boltgun. During the first round of each close combat, attacks made with the Custodian Spear are resolved at +1 Strength and +1 Initiative. LORD OF THE GAL VORBAK Argel Tal may select one Gal Vorbak Dark Brethren Squad as his personal retinue. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Elites selection. Argel Tal and the Gal Vorbak count as a single HQ selection.
• HQ
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
Unit Type:
• Jump Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Custodian Spear
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Daemon
• Fearless
• Lord of the Gal Vorbak
OPTIONS
• Argel Tal may take:
• Krak grenades ................................ +2 points
• Melta bombs ................................. +5 points</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-6-argel-tal-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-6-argel-tal-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-6-argel-tal-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xvii-6-argel-tal-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Argel Tal may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Melta bombs" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-6-argel-tal-opt-1-melta-bombs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-6-argel-tal-opt-1-melta-bombs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xvii-6-argel-tal-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Argel Tal may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="HIGH CHAPLAIN EREBUS" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="195" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xvii" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="allegiance-traitor" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Erebus" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Erebus | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
MASTER-CRAFTED ACCURSED CROZIUS Erebus' Accursed Crozius follows the normal rules from the Word Bearers Armoury and is additionally Master-crafted. ANATHAME DAGGER During an Assault phase, Erebus may exchange one of his normal Attacks for one attack with the Anathame Dagger. Invulnerable Saves may not be taken against this attack. If the attack inflicts an unsaved Wound upon a non-Vehicle model, it inflicts a Massive Wound (D3) instead of one Wound. Against Vehicles, it has no additional effect. HIGH CHAPLAIN Erebus counts as both a Legion Chaplain Consul and a Diabolist for all Word Bearers rules, army construction requirements and Rites of War. His presence therefore fulfils The Dark Shepherds and allows eligible units to purchase Dark Channelling. BURNING LORE Erebus has Burning Lore at no additional points cost and follows the normal rules presented in the Word Bearers Armoury. COMMAND RETINUE Erebus may select one Legion Command Squad as his retinue. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Master-crafted Accursed Crozius
• Bolt pistol
• Anathame Dagger
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Psyker (Mastery Level 1\)
• High Chaplain
• Burning Lore
OPTIONS
• Erebus may take:
• Krak grenades ................................ +2 points
• Melta bombs ................................. +5 points</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Erebus may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Melta bombs" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-opt-1-melta-bombs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-opt-1-melta-bombs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xvii-7-high-chaplain-erebus-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Erebus may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="KOR PHAERON, THE BLACK CARDINAL" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-8-kor-phaeron-the-black-cardinal"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="165" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xvii-8-kor-phaeron-the-black-cardinal-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xvii" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="allegiance-traitor" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-8-kor-phaeron-the-black-cardinal-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Kor Phaeron" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-8-kor-phaeron-the-black-cardinal-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvii-8-kor-phaeron-the-black-cardinal-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Kor Phaeron | 4 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 4 | 3 | 2 | 10 | 2+/4+
TERMINUS CONSOLARIS The Terminus Consolaris counts as Cataphractii Terminator Armour. Its extensive life-support systems grant Kor Phaeron Feel No Pain (6+). These rules are already reflected in his profile and Special Rules. BURNING LORE Kor Phaeron has Burning Lore at no additional points cost and follows the normal rules presented in the Word Bearers Armoury. BLACK CARDINAL Kor Phaeron counts as both a Dark Apostle and a Diabolist for all Word Bearers rules, army construction requirements and Rites of War. His presence therefore fulfils The Dark Shepherds and allows eligible units to purchase Dark Channelling. JEALOUS COMMAND If Kor Phaeron is included in the army, he must be the army's Warlord unless Lorgar is also included. COMMAND RETINUE Kor Phaeron may select one Legion Terminator Command Squad as his retinue. The squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Terminus Consolaris
• Pair of Lightning Claws
• Hand Flamer
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Psyker (Mastery Level 1\)
• Feel No Pain (6+)
• Burning Lore
• Black Cardinal
• Jealous Command</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="ZARDU LAYAK" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-9-zardu-layak"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="175" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xvii-9-zardu-layak-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xvii" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="allegiance-traitor" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xvii-9-zardu-layak-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Zardu Layak" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-9-zardu-layak-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvii-9-zardu-layak-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Zardu Layak | 5 | 5 | 4 | 5 | 2 | 5 | 2 | 10 | 2+/5+
PSYCHIC POWERS Zardu Layak selects two powers from Malefic Daemonology and follows all normal ProHammer rules for a Mastery Level 2 Psyker. CRIMSON APOSTLE Zardu Layak counts as both a Dark Apostle and a Diabolist for all Word Bearers rules, army construction requirements and Rites of War. DARK CHANNELER When rolling on the Dark Channelling table for a unit in an army containing Zardu Layak, add +1 to the result, to a maximum of 6. REIGN OF FIRE If Zardu Layak is the army's Warlord, Ashen Circle Squads may be selected as Troops choices. They may fulfil compulsory Troops selections. ANAKATIS KUL Zardu Layak may be accompanied by the Anakatis Kul Blade-Slaves for +100 points. Zardu Layak and the Blade-Slaves count as a single HQselection.
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Master-crafted Force Weapon
• Bolt pistol
• Legion Standard
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Daemon
• Zealot
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Crimson Apostle
• Dark Channeler
• Reign of Fire
OPTIONS
• Zardu Layak may take:
