3+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile><ns0:profile name="Infernus Sergeant" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-profile-1"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Infernus Destroyer | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Infernus Sergeant | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation
DUAL PISTOLS The unit uses the normal Dual Pistols rule from the Legiones Astartes Army List. DESTROYER CADRE An Infernus Destroyer Squad may only be joined by a Legion Moritat or another Character specifically stated to be permitted to join Destroyer units.
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Infernus Destroyers
• 1 Infernus Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Infernus Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Hardened Power Armour
• Two Hand Flamers
• Chainsword
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Salamanders)
• Counter-Attack
• Hardened Armour
• Dual Pistols
• Destroyer Cadre
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Infernus Destroyers for +25 points per model.
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
• Jump Packs .............................. +15 points per model
• For every five models in the squad, one Infernus Destroyer may replace one Hand Flamer with:
• Heavy Flamer with Suspensor Web .............. +10 points
• Multi-Melta with Suspensor Web ............... +15 points
• Any model may replace either Hand Flamer with:
• Volkite Serpenta ............................... +5 points
• Plasma pistol ................................ +15 points
INFERNUS SERGEANT
The Infernus Sergeant may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon ................................ +5 points
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• Lightning claw ............................... +15 points
• Power fist .................................... +15 points
• Thunder hammer ............................... +20 points
The Infernus Sergeant may replace either Hand Flamer with:
• Inferno Pistol ............................... +10 points
The Infernus Sergeant may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury and Salamanders Armoury.
JUMP PACKS
If every model is equipped with a Jump Pack, the unit becomes Jump Infantry and may not select a Dedicated Transport.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad without Jump Packs may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +25 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades (base unit; +2 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xviii-2-salamanders-infernus-destroyer-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide 