 hidden="false"><ns0:description>Sanctifier | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Sanctifier Sergeant | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
CLOSE-QUARTERS ARSENAL A Sanctifier equipped with two Pistol weapons has the Dual Pistols special rule. Both Pistols must fire at the same target.
Unit Composition:
• 4 Sanctifiers
• 1 Sanctifier Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Sanctifier Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolter
• Bolt pistol
• Chainsword
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Salamanders)
• Stubborn
• Close-Quarters Arsenal
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Sanctifiers for +25 points per model.
• Any Sanctifier may replace his Bolter with:
• Second Bolt pistol ................................. Free
• Rotor Cannon .................................. +10 points
• Any Sanctifier may replace his Bolter and Bolt pistol with:
• Two Hand Flamers .............................. +10 points
• Two Volkite Serpentae ........................ +10 points
• For every five models in the squad, one Sanctifier may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon ................................ +5 points
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
SANCTIFIER SERGEANT
The Sanctifier Sergeant may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon ................................ +5 points
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• Lightning claw ............................... +15 points
• Power fist .................................... +15 points
• Thunder hammer ............................... +20 points
The Sergeant may take:
• Artificer Armour ............................. +10 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +25 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Second Bolt pistol" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-opt-0-second-bolt-pistol"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-opt-0-second-bolt-pistol-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Any Sanctifier may replace his Bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Rotor Cannon" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-opt-1-rotor-cannon"><ns0