n="false"><ns0:description>Artellus Numeon | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
• HQ
SALAMANDERS MANTLE Numeon's Salamanders Mantle follows the normal rules presented in the Salamanders Armoury. CAPTAIN OF THE PYRE GUARD Numeon may select one Firedrake Terminator Squad as his personal retinue. One Firedrake in that unit may be upgraded to a Firedrake Master at no additional points cost. The squad does not occupy a separate Elites selection. VULKAN'S HEIR Numeon and any Salamanders unit he has joined may re-roll failed Morale tests. COMMAND RETINUE Instead of a Firedrake Terminator Squad, Numeon may select a Legion Command Squad or Legion Terminator Command Squad.
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Iron Halo
• Master-crafted Thunder hammer
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
• Salamanders Mantle
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Salamanders)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Captain of the Pyre Guard
• Vulkan's Heir
OPTIONS
• Numeon may take:
• Krak grenades ................................ +2 points
• Melta bombs ................................. +5 points</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-5-artellus-numeon-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-5-artellus-numeon-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xviii-5-artellus-numeon-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xviii-5-artellus-numeon-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Numeon may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Melta bombs" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-5-artellus-numeon-opt-1-melta-bombs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xviii-5-artellus-numeon-opt-1-melta-bombs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xviii-5-artellus-numeon-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Numeon may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="LORD CHAPLAIN NOMUS RHY'TAN" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="205" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xviii" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Nomus Rhy'tan" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Nomus Rhy'tan | 6 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
MANTLE OF THE ELDER DRAKE The Mantle of the Elder Drake counts as a Salamanders Mantle. DARKSTAR FALLING Darkstar Falling is a Two-Handed, Master-crafted Power Weapon. Attacks made with it are resolved at +2 Strength and have the Concussive special rule. Against Vehicles, attacks made with Darkstar Falling have Armourbane. LORD CHAPLAIN Nomus Rhy'tan counts as a Legion Chaplain Consul for all rules, army construction requirements and Rites of War. KEEPER OF THE KEYS One Legion Dreadnought or Legion Contemptor Dreadnought may be selected as a non-compulsory HQ choice. It may not fulfil the army's compulsory HQ selection and may not be the Warlord. COMMAND RETINUE Nomus may select a Legion Command Squad, Legion Terminator Command Squad or Firedrake Terminator Squad as his retinue.
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Unit Type:
