• Iron Halo
• Darkstar Falling
• Combi-flamer
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
• Mantle of the Elder Drake
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Salamanders)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Zealot
• Lord Chaplain
• Keeper of the Keys
