erer for every five models may replace his</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Multi-melta" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-2-deliverer-terminator-squad-opt-9-multi-melta"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-2-deliverer-terminator-squad-opt-9-multi-melta-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xix-2-deliverer-terminator-squad-opt-9-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• One Deliverer for every five models may replace his</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="RAPTOR SQUAD" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="160" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-cat" name="Elites" hidden="false" targetId="cat-elites" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="allegiance-loyalist" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Raptor" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">8</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile><ns0:profile name="Raptor Alpha" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-profile-1"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Raptor | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 2 | 8 | 3+
Raptor Alpha | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 3 | 9 | 3+
UNSTABLE CREATION Raptors may never fulfil compulsory Troops selections and may not be joined by an Independent Character other than Corax or Branne Nev.
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
Restriction:
• Loyalist only
Unit Composition:
• 4 Raptors
• 1 Raptor Alpha
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• Raptor Alpha is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Close-combat weapon
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Fleet
• Furious Charge
• Move Through Cover
• Rending — close combat attacks only
• Unstable Creation
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Raptors for +32 points per model.
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
• Melta bombs ............................. +5 points per model
• For every five models, one Raptor may replace his Bolt pistol with:
• Hand flamer ................................... +5 points
• Plasma pistol ................................ +15 points
• The Raptor Alpha may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="32" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +32 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades (base unit; +2 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-0-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-0-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +2 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Melta bombs (base unit; +5 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-1-melta-bombs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-1-melta-bombs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-1-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +5 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Hand flamer" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-2-hand-flamer"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-2-hand-flamer-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-2-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models, one Raptor may replace his Bolt pistol with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Plasma pistol" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-3-plasma-pistol"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-3-plasma-pistol-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-opt-3-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models, one Raptor may replace his Bolt pistol with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="KAEDES NEX" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-4-kaedes-nex"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="135" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xix-4-kaedes-nex-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-4-kaedes-nex-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Kaedes Nex" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-4-kaedes-nex-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-4-kaedes-nex-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Kaedes Nex | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+/5+
Kaedes Nex may replace the Sergeant of one Raven Guard Legion Destroyer Squad. Remove the normal Sergeant and include Kaedes Nex for 135 points instead. Kaedes Nex remains part of the squad, is not an Independent Character and does not occupy a separate Force Organisation choice.
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Refractor Field
• Two Fulcrum Hand Cannons
• Rending Weapon
• Jump Pack
• Frag grenades
• Krak grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Dangerous Weaponry
• The Raven's Due
• Executioner's Instinct
No Independent Character may join Kaedes Nex's squad.
THE RAVEN'S DUE At the beginning of the battle, nominate one enemy Independent Character or unit-upgrade Character. Kaedes Nex may re-roll failed To Hit rolls against the nominated model in close combat. When Nex fires his Fulcrum Hand Cannons at a unit containing the nominated model, he may re-roll failed To Hit rolls. Unsaved Wounds caused by Nex's shooting may be allocated to the nominated model before other casualties, provided that model is within range and line of sight. EXECUTIONER'S INSTINCT If Kaedes Nex causes one or more unsaved Wounds upon his nominated target, that model's unit must immediately take a Pinning test.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="ALVAREX MAUN" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="140" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Alvarex Maun" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Alvarex Maun | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 2+/5+
Alvarex Maun may be selected as an HQ choice in a Raven Guard Detachment.
COMMAND SQUAD Alvarex Maun may be accompanied by a Legion Command Squad. Maun and the Command Squad count as a single HQ selection. TOLAEDUS Tolaedus counts as a Master-crafted Power Weapon. NIGHTFALL PATTERN STRATO-VOX The Nightfall Pattern Strato-Vox counts as a Nuncio Vox. In addition, once during each Raven Guard turn, one friendly Raven Guard unit deploying by Deep Strike with its first model within 12" of Maun may re-roll the dice rolled for scatter distance. The second result must be accepted. MASTER OF DESCENT If Alvarex Maun begins the battle in Reserve embarked aboard a Drop Pod, Dreadclaw or Flyer Transport, Maun and that Transport arrive automatically during the first Raven Guard turn. No Reserve roll is required.
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Bolt pistol
• Tolaedus
• Nightfall Pattern Strato-Vox
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Master of Descent</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="AGAPITO NEV" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-6-agapito-nev"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="140" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xix-6-agapito-nev-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-6-agapito-nev-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Agapito Nev" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-6-agapito-nev-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-6-agapito-nev-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Agapito Nev | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 5 | 4 | 10 | 3+/5+
Agapito Nev may replace the Dark Fury Strike Leader of one Dark Fury Assault Squad.
Remove the normal Strike Leader and include Agapito Nev for 140 points instead.
Agapito remains part of the squad and possesses all special rules belonging to the Dark Fury Assault Squad.
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Refractor Field
• Jump Pack
• Bolter
• Power weapon
• Close-combat weapon
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Commander of the Talons
• First Into the Fray
COMMANDER OF THE TALONS An army containing Agapito Nev may include up to two Dark Fury Assault Squads rather than the normal 0–1. Agapito's squad may also re-roll failed Morale tests caused by shooting casualties. FIRST INTO THE FRAY During an Assault phase in which Agapito and his squad charge, the squad may re-roll all failed To Hit rolls during the first round of that close combat.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="BRANNE NEV" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-7-branne-nev"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="155" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xix-7-branne-nev-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-7-branne-nev-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Branne Nev" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-7-branne-nev-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-7-branne-nev-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Branne Nev | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
Branne Nev may be selected as an HQ choice in a Raven Guard Detachment.
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Bolter
• Bolt pistol
• Power weapon
• Frag grenades
• Krak grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Commander of the Survivors
• Hold Fast
COMMANDER OF THE SURVIVORS If the army includes Branne Nev, one Raptor Squad may be selected without occupying an Elites choice. That unit still counts as an Elites unit for all other purposes and may not fulfil a compulsory selection. Branne Nev may join a Raptor Squad despite the restrictions of Unstable Creation. HOLD FAST Branne Nev and any Raven Guard unit he has joined may re-roll failed Morale and Pinning tests.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="NYKONA SHARROWKYN" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-8-nykona-sharrowkyn"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="125" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xix-8-nykona-sharrowkyn-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-8-nykona-sharrowkyn-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Nykona Sharrowkyn" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-8-nykona-sharrowkyn-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-8-nykona-sharrowkyn-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Nykona Sharrowkyn | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 5 | 3 | 9 | 2+/5+
Nykona Sharrowkyn may replace the Sergeant or Veteran Sergeant of one Raven Guard Legion Seeker Squad or Legion
Reconnaissance Squad. Remove the normal Sergeant and include Sharrowkyn for 125 points instead.
Sharrowkyn remains part of the squad, is not an Independent Character and does not occupy a separate Force Organisation choice.
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Bolt pistol
• Sniper Rifle
• Sudden Blade
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Infiltrate
• Move Through Cover
• Ghost in the Dark
• Perfect Ambusher
GHOST IN THE DARK While Sharrowkyn's unit is in cover, improve its Cover Save by 1, to a maximum of 3+. PERFECT AMBUSHER When Sharrowkyn shoots at an enemy unit within 12", he may re-roll failed To Hit rolls. SUDDEN BLADE Sudden Blade counts as a Master-crafted Rending Weapon.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="XIX — CORVUS CORAX, THE RAVEN-LORD" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-9-xix-corvus-corax-the-raven-lord"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="500" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xix-9-xix-corvus-corax-the-raven-lord-cat" name="Lords of War" hidden="false" targetId="cat-low" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="allegiance-loyalist" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xix-9-xix-corvus-corax-the-raven-lord-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Corvus Corax" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-9-xix-corvus-corax-the-raven-lord-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">8</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">7</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">8</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">6</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">1+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-9-xix-corvus-corax-the-raven-lord-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Primarch of the Raven Guard, the Raven-Lord, the Deliverer
Corvus Corax was the liberator of Deliverance and master of the XIX Legion, a warrior whose understanding of stealth, infiltration and sudden violence stood apart even among the Primarchs. Raised among the enslaved population of Lycaeus, Corax learned that a stronger enemy need not be met upon ground of its choosing. Instead, its commanders could be isolated, its communications severed and its strength rendered meaningless before the decisive blow was struck.
In battle the Raven-Lord seemed less a general than an apparition, descending upon vital positions before disappearing again into smoke and darkness. His Legion reflected this philosophy, favouring reconnaissance, sabotage and precisely delivered assaults over wars of attrition. The older Raven Guard material likewise centres Corax and his Legion on covert operations, infiltration and lightning strikes rather than headlong assault.
Corvus Corax | 8 | 7 | 6 | 6 | 6 | 8 | 6 | 10 | 1+
Force Organisation:
• Lord of War
Unit Composition:
• 1 Corvus Corax
Unit Type:
• Jump Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Sable Armour
• Korvidine Pinions
• Corvidine Talons
• Wrath &amp; Justice
• Frag Grenades
Special Rules:
• Primarch
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• The Shadowed Lord
• Surgical Strike
• Sire of the Raven Guard
• Secret Deployment
RESTRICTIONS
Corvus Corax may only be selected for a Loyalist Raven Guard army. He otherwise follows all normal rules and restrictions for Primarchs.
SABLE ARMOUR The black war-plate of the Raven-Lord incorporated sophisticated systems of concealment and disruption, allowing Corax to move through the battlefield with an uncanny ability to escape detection. The Sable Armour counts as Primarch Armour. KORVIDINE PINIONS A highly advanced flight system incorporated into Corax’s armour, the Korvidine Pinions allowed the Raven-Lord to cross the battlefield with a speed and freedom of movement few warriors could match. Corvus Corax is treated as Jump Infantry and follows all normal ProHammer rules for Jump Infantry. His ability to move as Jump Infantry may never be lost, disabled or destroyed as the result of damage to wargear. CORVIDINE TALONS The Corvidine Talons were a matched pair of vicious powered blades designed for the Raven-Lord’s preferred method of sudden and overwhelming close assault. The Corvidine Talons are a matched pair of Power Weapons. Attacks made with them are resolved at +1 Strength and have the Shred and Rending special rules. They count as two close combat weapons. WRATH &amp; JUSTICE Wrath and Justice were a matched pair of archaeotech pistols carried by Corax, their destructive power complementing the speed with which the Raven-Lord closed upon his prey. Weapon Range S AP Type Wrath &amp; Justice 12" 6 4 Assault 2, Rending, Master-crafted THE SHADOWED LORD Corax possessed an almost preternatural ability to disappear amidst darkness, smoke and the confusion of battle, striking without warning before escaping retaliation. Corvus Corax has the Stealth and Hit &amp; Run special rules. SIRE OF THE RAVEN GUARD Under the direction of their gene-sire, the warriors of the XIX Legion exploited every shadow, ruin and fragment of cover to its fullest advantage. Friendly Raven Guard Infantry units with at least one model within 12" of Corvus Corax improve any Cover Save they receive by 1, to a maximum of 3+. SECRET DEPLOYMENT Few enemies ever knew precisely where Corax would strike until the Raven-Lord was already amongst them. Instead of deploying Corvus Corax normally, the Raven Guard player may secretly record one terrain feature which lies outside the enemy deployment zone. Corax is then held off the battlefield.At the beginning of any Raven Guard Movement phase from the second turn onwards, the controlling player may reveal the recorded terrain feature. Place Corax wholly within or in contact with that terrain feature and more than 6" from every enemy model. Corax may Move, Shoot and declare charges normally during the turn in which he is revealed. No Reserve roll is required. If it is impossible to place Corax legally within or in contact with the nominated terrain feature, he may not be revealed that turn and may attempt to deploy there during a later Raven Guard turn. If Corax has selected a Primarch Retinue, the Retinue is deployed normally and does not accompany him when using Secret Deployment. PRIMARCH RETINUE Corvus Corax may select any one of the following as his Primarch Retinue: • Legion Honour Guard Squad • Legion Terminator Command Squad • Dark Fury Assault Squad • Raptor Squad A retinue selected in this manner does not occupy an additional Force Organisation selection and otherwise follows the normal Primarch Retinue rules. Corax may join a Raptor Squad despite the normal restrictions of the Unstable Creation special rule. THE AVENGING SHADOW — POST-ISTVAAN VARIANT Corvus Corax may be fielded as the Avenging Shadow at no additional points cost. This represents Corax during the aftermath of the Dropsite Massacre, clad in hastily repaired armour and consumed by a bitter campaign of vengeance against the Traitor Legions. If this variant is selected, make the following changes: PATCHWORK PANOPLY The shattered armour of the Raven-Lord was repaired with whatever materials could be salvaged in the aftermath of Istvaan, sacrificing some of its former protection for survival and mobility. Corax has a 2+ Armour Save and 4+ Invulnerable Save instead of the normal protection provided by Primarch Armour. His armour still counts as Primarch Armour for all other purposes. GHOST OF ISTVAAN Hunted across the shattered wastes of Istvaan V, Corax became a spectre amongst the ruins, appearing only long enough to kill before vanishing once more. Corax replaces the Stealth special rule granted by The Shadowed Lord with Shrouded. He retains Hit &amp; Run normally. HATER OF TRAITORS The betrayal at Istvaan transformed Corax’s hatred of oppression into a personal and implacable desire for vengeance. Corax has Hatred (Traitor Legiones Astartes).</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="LEGION OPERATIVES" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="60" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-cat" name="Troops" hidden="false" targetId="cat-troops" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xx" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Operative" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">7</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">6+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile><ns0:profile name="Operative Leader" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-profile-1"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">8</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">6+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Operative | 3 | 3 | 3 | 3 | 1 | 3 | 1 | 7 | 6+
Operative Leader | 3 | 3 | 3 | 3 | 1 | 3 | 2 | 8 | 6+
Force Organisation:
• Troops
Unit Composition:
• 10 Legion Operatives
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• Operative Leader is a Character
Wargear:
• Close-combat weapon
• Laspistol or Autopistol
Special Rules:
• Operative Cell
• Human Agents
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to ten additional Operatives for +6 points per model.
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ........................... +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +1 point per model
• Melta bombs ............................. +2 points per model
• One Operative may be upgraded to an Operative Leader for +5 points.
• The Operative Leader may select up to 10 points of weapons from the Space Marine Armoury.
OPERATIVE CELL Before deployment, select one of the following skill sets for the unit at no additional points cost: - Scouts The unit gains Infiltrate and Move Through Cover. - Assassins The unit gains Infiltrate and Furious Charge. - Saboteurs The unit gains Infiltrate and Siege Specialists. HUMAN AGENTS Legion Operatives do not possess Legiones Astartes and do not benefit from Mutable Tactics or other rules which specifically affect Alpha Legion Space Marines.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="10" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="6" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 10 additional models at +6 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Frag grenades (base unit; +1 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-0-frag-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-0-frag-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-0-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +1 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades (base unit; +1 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-1-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-1-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-1-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +1 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Melta bombs (base unit; +2 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-2-melta-bombs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-opt-2-melta-bombs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:con