Headhunter Prime | 4 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 4 Headhunters
• 1 Headhunter Prime
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• Headhunter Prime is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolter
• Banestrike Ammunition
• Kraken Bolts
• Close-combat weapon
• Frag grenades
• Melta bombs
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion)
• Infiltrate
• Move Through Cover
• All as Planned
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Headhunters for +32 points per model.
• Up to two Headhunters may replace their Bolter with:
• Heavy flamer ................................ +10 points
• Meltagun ..................................... +10 points
• Plasma Gun ................................... +15 points
• Multi-melta .................................. +25 points
• Heavy Bolter with Suspensor and
Hellfire Rounds .............................. +15 points
• Any model may take:
• Power Dagger ................................. +5 points
• The Headhunter Prime may take:
• Artificer Armour ............................ +10 points
• Venom Spheres ................................ +5 points
• The Headhunter Prime may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
ALL AS PLANNED After both armies have deployed but before the first turn begins, the Headhunter Kill Team may make one Pre-emptive Strike using the rules presented under the Legion Saboteur entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-1-headhunter-kill-team-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xx-1-headhunter-kill-team-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="32" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r41-unit-xx-1-headhunter-kill-team-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +32 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-1-headhunter-kill-team-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Heavy flamer" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-1-headhunter-kill-team-opt-0-heavy-flamer"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r41-unit-xx-1-headhunter-kill-team-opt-0-heavy-flamer-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xx-1-headhunter-kill-team-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Up to two Headhunters may replace their Bolter with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Mel