        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Hexagrammaton Wing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter" collective="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="min" />
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:modifiers>
            <ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
              <ns0:conditions>
                <ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </ns0:conditions>
            </ns0:modifier>
            <ns0:modifier type="set" value="1" field="da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-min">
              <ns0:conditions>
                <ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </ns0:conditions>
            </ns0:modifier>
          </ns0:modifiers>
          <ns0:selectionEntries>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Stormwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-0">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-0-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Stormwing" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-0-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>First Fire/Overwatch: re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 with Bolters, Bolt Pistols, Storm Bolters, Foeblaster Boltguns and bolter component of combi-weapons. If The Storm of War is selected: stationary Stormwing units also use the Stormwing re-roll during the normal Shooting phase; Stormwing Infantry containing a Stormwing Character gains Stubborn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Deathwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-1">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-1-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Deathwing" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-1-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>With a sword-type weapon against an enemy whose Weapon Skill is higher than the model’s own, re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in close combat. If The Unbroken Vow is selected: a Deathwing unit within 6" of an Objective gains Feel No Pain (6+), or improves existing Feel No Pain by one step to a maximum of 4+; a Deathwing Independent Character within 12" of an Objective gains +1 Attack.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Dreadwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-2">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-2-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Dreadwing" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-2-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Flame, Plasma and Volkite attacks against this unit are -1 Strength (minimum 1); against Dreadwing Vehicles/Dreadnoughts this also reduces Armour Penetration Strength. If The Eskaton Imperative is selected: Dreadwing Infantry gain Move Through Cover and all Dreadwing models may re-roll failed Dangerous Terrain tests.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ironwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-3">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-3-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ironwing" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-3-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against enemy Vehicles. Ironwing Vehicles firing Snap Shots hit on 5+ instead of 6+. If The Steel Fist is selected: a Transport Vehicle carrying an Ironwing Independent Character gains a 6+ Invulnerable Save against shooting, or improves an existing Invulnerable Save by one step to a maximum of 4+.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Firewing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-4">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-4-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Firewing" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-4-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 when attacking an enemy unit containing an Independent Character, in shooting and close combat. If The Serpent’s Bane is selected: against a nominated Priority Target, Firewing models re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 and To Wound rolls of 1 (Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against Vehicles); a Firewing Independent Character gains +1 Attack in melee with a Priority Target. Up to three Firewing Troops units may select Forward Deployment — Infiltrate.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ravenwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-5">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-5-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ravenwing" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-da-wing-fa-sky-hunter-5-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Dark Angels Bikes and Jetbikes gain Skilled Rider; Dark Angels Land Speeders gain Jink. If The Seeker’s Arrow is selected: Ravenwing Infantry, Bikes and Jetbikes gain Outflank; Ravenwing Bikes and Jetbikes gain Hit &amp; Run. At the start of each Dark Angels turn choose +2" Turbo-Boost/Advance, +2" Charge, or +2" Consolidation for all Ravenwing units until the next Dark Angels turn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
          </ns0:selectionEntries>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
      </ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
    <ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden" id="r42-role-v-0-effects-ride-like-the-wind-legion-sky-hunter-jetbike-squadrons-hide"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="r25-rite-v-0-chogorian-brotherhood" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers></ns0:selectionEntry>
    <ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="PHALANX WARDER SQUAD" hidden="true" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad"><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="150" /></ns0:costs><ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:categoryLink id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-cat" name="Troops" hidden="false" targetId="cat-troops" primary="true" /></ns0:categoryLinks><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-vii" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-hide"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="r25-rite-vii-0-the-stone-gauntlet" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers><ns0:profiles><ns0:profile name="Phalanx Warder" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile><ns0:profile name="Warder Sergeant" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-profile-1"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Phalanx Warder | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 9 | 3+/5+
Warder Sergeant | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Phalanx Warders
• 1 Warder Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Warder Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Boarding Shield
• Bolter
• Power weapon
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Imperial Fists)
• Stubborn
• Counter-Attack
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Phalanx Warders for +28 points per model.
• For every five models, one Phalanx Warder may replace his
Bolter with:
• Flamer ............................................ +5 points
• Meltagun ......................................... +10 points
• Plasma gun ....................................... +15 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ............................... +1 point per model
• Krak grenades .............................. +2 points per model
• Melta bombs ................................ +5 points per model
• One model may carry:
• Legion Vexilla ................................... +10 points
• One other model may carry:
• Nuncio Vox ...................................... +10 points
WARDER SERGEANT
The Warder Sergeant may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-rite-note" name="Rite of War Interaction" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The Stone Gauntlet is the embodiment of the VII Legion's doctrine of unyielding defence.
Warriors advance shoulder to shoulder behind interlocking shields, absorbing the fury of the enemy before crushing resistance beneath a methodical counter-assault.
EFFECTS
WARDERS OF THE PHALANX
Phalanx Warder Squads may be selected as Troops choices.
They may fulfil compulsory Troops selections.
Legion Breacher Siege Squads may also fulfil compulsory Troops selections normally.
SHIELD WALL
An Imperial Fists Infantry unit in which every model is equipped with either a Boarding Shield or Vigil Pattern Storm Shield may form a Shield Wall. The Shield Wall is active provided that:
• the unit did not Advance during its preceding Movement phase;
• the unit is not Falling Back;
• the unit did not charge during the current player turn.
While the Shield Wall is active, models in the unit may re-roll failed Invulnerable Saves granted by Boarding Shields or Vigil Pattern Storm Shields. A re-rolled save may never be re-rolled again.
UNYIELDING LINE
While its Shield Wall is active, the unit gains the Stubborn special rule and may re-roll failed Pinning tests.
THE HAMMER BEHIND THE SHIELD
Models equipped with Boarding Shields gain the Hammer of Wrath special rule.
This uses the normal ProHammer definition of Hammer of Wrath.
A model does not receive an additional attack; instead, one of its normally allowed attacks may be resolved at Initiative 10 during a turn in which it charges.
LIMITATIONS
The army's compulsory Troops choices must be selected from:
• Legion Breacher Siege Squads
• Phalanx Warder Squads
The Detachment must include at least one Independent Character equipped with either a Boarding Shield or Vigil Pattern Storm Shield.
No unit in the Detachment may voluntarily deploy using Deep Strike.
The army may include no more than one Fast Attack choice.</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-clone-cleanup" name="Builder compatibility" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Removed 1 obsolete armoury link(s) inherited from the generic source entry while creating this Rite-specific battlefield-role copy.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="28" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +28 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Flamer" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-0-flamer"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-0-flamer-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models, one Phalanx Warder may replace his</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Meltagun" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-1-meltagun"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-1-meltagun-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models, one Phalanx Warder may replace his</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Plasma gun" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-2-plasma-gun"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-2-plasma-gun-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-2-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• For every five models, one Phalanx Warder may replace his</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Frag grenades (base unit; +1 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-3-frag-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-3-frag-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-3-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalanx-warder-squad-opt-3-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +1 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades (base unit; +2 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r42-role-vii-0-effects-warders-of-the-phalanx-phalanx-warder-squads-r41-unit-vii-1-phalan