-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-profile-0"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile><ns0:profile name="Rampager Champion" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-profile-1"><ns0:characteristics><ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic><ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</ns0:characteristic></ns0:characteristics></ns0:profile></ns0:profiles><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Source Entry" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-source" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Rampager | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Rampager Champion | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
CAEDERE WEAPONS Caedere Weapons represent the many gladiatorial blades, axes, hooks and other fighting weapons employed by the XII Legion. For the purposes of these rules, a Caedere Weapon counts as a Rending Weapon.
Unit Composition:
• 4 Rampagers
• 1 Rampager Champion
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Rampager Champion is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Chainaxe
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Rampagers for +22 points per model.
• Up to three Rampagers may replace their Chainaxe with:
• Caedere Weapon ................................. +3 points
• Power weapon ................................... +7 points
• If the squad numbers ten models, up to six Rampagers may make one of the above exchanges.
• Up to three Rampagers may replace their Bolt pistol with:
• Plasma pistol ................................. +10 points
• If the squad numbers ten models, up to six Rampagers may make this exchange.
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ............................ +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
• Jump Packs .............................. +15 points per model
If equipped with Jump Packs, the unit becomes Jump Infantry and may not select a Dedicated Transport.
RAMPAGER CHAMPION
The Rampager Champion may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad without Jump Packs may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-rite-note" name="Rite of War Interaction" hidden="false"><ns0:description>A Berserker Assault commits the XII Legion to a single overwhelming attack, massed assault formations racing ahead of their support elements to close with the enemy before disciplined resistance can be organised.
EFFECTS
THE RED HAND
Rampager Squads may be selected as Troops choices and may fulfil compulsory Troops selections.
Legion Assault Squads may fulfil compulsory Troops selections normally.
HEADLONG ASSAULT
World Eaters Infantry and Jump Infantry units gain the Fleet special rule.
A unit with Fleet may charge after making an Advance move, following the normal ProHammer rules.
WEAPONS OF THE PITS
World Eaters models in Legion Assault Squads and Rampager Squads may purchase Chainaxes for +2 points per model instead of the normal +4 points.
BLOOD FORWARD
A non-Vehicle World Eaters unit must declare a charge during its Assault phase if it is normally eligible to charge and at least one enemy unit is within its current charge distance.
If more than one legal target is available, the World Eaters player may choose which unit is charged.
LIMITATIONS
The army's compulsory Troops choices must be Legion Assault Squads or Rampager Squads.
At least one compulsory Troops choice must be a Rampager Squad.
The army's Warlord must be equipped with a Chainaxe, Caedere Weapon, Rending Weapon, Power Weapon or another close-combat weapon.
The Detachment may include no more than one Heavy Support choice.
The Detachment may not include a Fortification.</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-clone-cleanup" name="Builder compatibility" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Removed 1 obsolete armoury link(s) inherited from the generic source entry while creating this Rite-specific battlefield-role copy.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Additional model" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-additional"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="22" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Additional model" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-additional-rule" hidden="false"><ns0:description>May include up to 5 additional models at +22 points each, as stated in the source entry.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntryGroups><ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-options" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:selectionEntries><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Caedere Weapon" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-0-caedere-weapon"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-0-caedere-weapon-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="3" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="3" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-0-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Up to three Rampagers may replace their Chainaxe with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Power weapon" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-1-power-weapon"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-1-power-weapon-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="3" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="7" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-1-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Up to three Rampagers may replace their Chainaxe with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Plasma pistol" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-2-plasma-pistol"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-2-plasma-pistol-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="3" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-2-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• Up to three Rampagers may replace their Bolt pistol with:</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Frag grenades (base unit; +1 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-3-frag-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-3-frag-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-3-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-3-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +1 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades (base unit; +2 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-4-krak-grenades"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-4-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-4-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-4-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +2 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Jump Packs (base unit; +15 pts/model)" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-5-jump-packs"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-5-jump-packs-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="75" /></ns0:costs><ns0:rules><ns0:rule name="Option restriction" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-5-context" hidden="false"><ns0:description>• The entire squad may take:</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule name="Squad-wide cost note" id="r42-role-xii-0-effects-the-red-hand-rampager-squads-r41-unit-xii-0-rampager-squad-opt-5-squadwide" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The source prices this option at +15 points per model. The displayed selection charges the parsed base unit only; apply the same per-model surcharge for any additional models selected.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules></ns0:selectionEntry></ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups></ns0:selectionEntry><ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Legion Veteran Squad" hidden="true" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-unit">
      <ns0:categoryLinks>
        <ns0:categoryLink id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-unit-cat" name="Troops" hidden="false" targetId="cat-troops" primary="true" /></ns0:categoryLinks>
      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule name="Standard Wargear" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-standard" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>Every model is equipped with Power Armour, a Bolter, Bolt Pistol, Chainsword and Frag Grenades unless replaced by an option below.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
        <ns0:rule name="Legiones Astartes" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-legiones" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>All models have the Legiones Astartes special rule and And They Shall Know No Fear as presented in ProHammer Classic. They are not Fearless.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
        <ns0:rule name="Veteran Tactics" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-tactics-rule" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>When constructing the army, select one Veteran Tactic for this squad. The chosen ability applies to every model in the squad for the duration of the battle.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
        <ns0:rule name="Dedicated Transport" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-transport-rule" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>If not equipped with Jump Packs, the squad may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where permitted. Land Raider choices will become selectable when their vehicle entries are added; the rule remains in force now.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      <ns0:rule id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-rite-note" name="Rite of War Interaction" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The Reaping is one of the characteristic attack formations of the XIV Legion. Heavy infantry and fire-support units advance in a relentless column, purging shattered cities and fortified battlefields through weight of fire and remorseless attrition.
EFFECTS
SUPERIOR FIREPOWER
Legion Veteran Squads and Legion Heavy Support Squads may be selected as non-compulsory Troops choices.
They may not fulfil compulsory Troops selections unless another rule specifically permits them to do so.
IMPLACABLE
All Death Guard Infantry units gain the Move Through Cover special rule.
This includes models wearing any form of Terminator Armour.
DARK ARSENAL
Any Death Guard Character or Independent Character may purchase Rad Grenades for +10 points.
Rad Grenades follow the normal rules presented in the Legiones Astartes Army List.
LIMITATIONS
Units in the Detachment may not make Advance Moves.
Vehicles in the Detachment may not move Flat Out.
Units in the Detachment may not deploy using Deep Strike. Units which are required to deploy using Deep Strike may not be selected.
The normal Death Guard restriction on Fast Attack choices from Footslogging Killers continues to apply.</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-clone-cleanup" name="Builder compatibility" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Removed 3 obsolete armoury link(s) inherited from the generic source entry while creating this Rite-specific battlefield-role copy.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules>
      <ns0:selectionEntries>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Legion Veterans (included)" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-included" defaultAmount="4">
          <ns0:constraints>
