                  <ns0:description>First Fire/Overwatch: re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 with Bolters, Bolt Pistols, Storm Bolters, Foeblaster Boltguns and bolter component of combi-weapons. If The Storm of War is selected: stationary Stormwing units also use the Stormwing re-roll during the normal Shooting phase; Stormwing Infantry containing a Stormwing Character gains Stubborn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Deathwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-1">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-1-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Deathwing" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-1-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>With a sword-type weapon against an enemy whose Weapon Skill is higher than the model’s own, re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in close combat. If The Unbroken Vow is selected: a Deathwing unit within 6" of an Objective gains Feel No Pain (6+), or improves existing Feel No Pain by one step to a maximum of 4+; a Deathwing Independent Character within 12" of an Objective gains +1 Attack.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Dreadwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-2">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-2-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Dreadwing" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-2-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Flame, Plasma and Volkite attacks against this unit are -1 Strength (minimum 1); against Dreadwing Vehicles/Dreadnoughts this also reduces Armour Penetration Strength. If The Eskaton Imperative is selected: Dreadwing Infantry gain Move Through Cover and all Dreadwing models may re-roll failed Dangerous Terrain tests.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ironwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-3">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-3-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ironwing" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-3-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against enemy Vehicles. Ironwing Vehicles firing Snap Shots hit on 5+ instead of 6+. If The Steel Fist is selected: a Transport Vehicle carrying an Ironwing Independent Character gains a 6+ Invulnerable Save against shooting, or improves an existing Invulnerable Save by one step to a maximum of 4+.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Firewing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-4">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-4-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Firewing" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-4-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 when attacking an enemy unit containing an Independent Character, in shooting and close combat. If The Serpent’s Bane is selected: against a nominated Priority Target, Firewing models re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 and To Wound rolls of 1 (Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against Vehicles); a Firewing Independent Character gains +1 Attack in melee with a Priority Target. Up to three Firewing Troops units may select Forward Deployment — Infiltrate.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
            <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ravenwing" hidden="false" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-5">
              <ns0:constraints>
                <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-5-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </ns0:constraints>
              <ns0:rules>
                <ns0:rule name="Ravenwing" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-da-wing-hs-spartan-5-rule" hidden="false">
                  <ns0:description>Dark Angels Bikes and Jetbikes gain Skilled Rider; Dark Angels Land Speeders gain Jink. If The Seeker’s Arrow is selected: Ravenwing Infantry, Bikes and Jetbikes gain Outflank; Ravenwing Bikes and Jetbikes gain Hit &amp; Run. At the start of each Dark Angels turn choose +2" Turbo-Boost/Advance, +2" Charge, or +2" Consolidation for all Ravenwing units until the next Dark Angels turn.</ns0:description>
                </ns0:rule>
              </ns0:rules>
            </ns0:selectionEntry>
          </ns0:selectionEntries>
        </ns0:selectionEntryGroup>
      <ns0:selectionEntryGroup id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-r40-da-ammo-hs-spartan" name="Dark Angels Armoury — Ammunition" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><ns0:entryLinks><ns0:entryLink id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-r40-da-ammo-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-p6" name="Molecular Acid Shells (for Heavy Bolter)" type="selectionEntry" targetId="da22-acid-hb" hidden="true" import="true"><ns0:constraints><ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-r40-da-ammo-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-p6-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" /></ns0:constraints><ns0:costs><ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="7" /></ns0:costs><ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="false" field="hidden"><ns0:conditionGroups><ns0:conditionGroup type="and"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" /><ns0:condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-p6" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:conditionGroup></ns0:conditionGroups></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers></ns0:entryLink></ns0:entryLinks></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
      <ns0:selectionEntries>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Hunter-Killer Missile" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-hunter-killer-missile" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-hunter-killer-missile-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Hunter-Killer Missile" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-hunter-killer-missile-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Unlimited range, S8 AP3, Heavy 1, One Use.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Dozer Blade" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-dozer-blade" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-dozer-blade-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="5" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Dozer Blade" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-dozer-blade-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Use the normal ProHammer Dozer Blade rule.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Auxiliary Drive" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-auxiliary-drive" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-auxiliary-drive-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Auxiliary Drive" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-auxiliary-drive-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>At the start of the controlling player's Movement phase, if Immobilised, on a 4+ remove one Immobilised result.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Frag Assault Launchers" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-frag-assault-launchers" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-frag-assault-launchers-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Frag Assault Launchers" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-frag-assault-launchers-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Passengers charging during the same turn they disembark count as equipped with Frag Grenades for that Assault phase.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Armoured Ceramite" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-armoured-ceramite" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-armoured-ceramite-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Armoured Ceramite" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-armoured-ceramite-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Melta weapons do not gain an additional Armour Penetration die against this vehicle.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Flare Shield" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-flare-shield" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-flare-shield-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="45" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Flare Shield" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-r40-da-steel-transport-veteran-unit-hs-spartan-hs-spartan-flare-shield-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Against shooting attacks striking the Front Armour, reduce the Strength of Blast and Template weapons by 2 and all other ranged attacks by 1. No effect in close combat.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
      </ns0:selectionEntries>
    </ns0:selectionEntry>
    </ns0:selectionEntries></ns0:selectionEntryGroup></ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
    <ns0:modifiers><ns0:modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-hide"><ns0:conditions><ns0:condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="r25-rite-xiv-0-the-reaping" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></ns0:conditions></ns0:modifier></ns0:modifiers></ns0:selectionEntry>
    <ns0:selectionEntry type="unit" name="Legion Heavy Support Squad" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-heavy-support-squad" hidden="true" import="true">
      <ns0:categoryLinks>
        <ns0:categoryLink id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-heavy-support-squad-cat" name="Troops" hidden="false" targetId="cat-troops" primary="true" /></ns0:categoryLinks>
      <ns0:costs>
        <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="75" />
      </ns0:costs>
      <ns0:profiles>
        <ns0:profile name="Legion Space Marine" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-marine-prof" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false">
          <ns0:characteristics>
            <ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">1</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">8</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</ns0:characteristic>
          </ns0:characteristics>
        </ns0:profile>
        <ns0:profile name="Legion Sergeant" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-sergeant-prof" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false">
          <ns0:characteristics>
            <ns0:characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</ns0:characteristic>
            <ns0:characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</ns0:characteristic>
          </ns0:characteristics>
        </ns0:profile>
      </ns0:profiles>
      <ns0:rules>
        <ns0:rule name="Standard Wargear" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-wargear" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>4 Legion Space Marines and 1 Legion Sergeant. Power Armour, Bolter, Bolt pistol and Frag grenades. The unit has Legiones Astartes; the Sergeant is a Character.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
        <ns0:rule name="Sergeant Armoury" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-armoury-rule" hidden="false">
          <ns0:description>The Sergeant may select up to 50 points of additional permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury. Normal Sergeant weapon limits apply. Unit-specific replacements take precedence over duplicate Armoury purchases.</ns0:description>
        </ns0:rule>
      <ns0:rule id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-rite-note" name="Rite of War Interaction" hidden="false"><ns0:description>The Reaping is one of the characteristic attack formations of the XIV Legion. Heavy infantry and fire-support units advance in a relentless column, purging shattered cities and fortified battlefields through weight of fire and remorseless attrition.
EFFECTS
SUPERIOR FIREPOWER
Legion Veteran Squads and Legion Heavy Support Squads may be selected as non-compulsory Troops choices.
They may not fulfil compulsory Troops selections unless another rule specifically permits them to do so.
IMPLACABLE
All Death Guard Infantry units gain the Move Through Cover special rule.
This includes models wearing any form of Terminator Armour.
DARK ARSENAL
Any Death Guard Character or Independent Character may purchase Rad Grenades for +10 points.
Rad Grenades follow the normal rules presented in the Legiones Astartes Army List.
LIMITATIONS
Units in the Detachment may not make Advance Moves.
Vehicles in the Detachment may not move Flat Out.
Units in the Detachment may not deploy using Deep Strike. Units which are required to deploy using Deep Strike may not be selected.
The normal Death Guard restriction on Fast Attack choices from Footslogging Killers continues to apply.</ns0:description></ns0:rule><ns0:rule id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-clone-cleanup" name="Builder compatibility" hidden="false"><ns0:description>Removed 1 obsolete armoury link(s) inherited from the generic source entry while creating this Rite-specific battlefield-role copy.</ns0:description></ns0:rule></ns0:rules>
      <ns0:selectionEntries>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Additional Legion Space Marine" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-additional" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-additional-max" type="max" value="5" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="15" />
          </ns0:costs>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
        <ns0:selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Hardened Armour (entire squad)" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-hardened" hidden="false" import="true">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-hardened-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:costs>
            <ns0:cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="25" />
          </ns0:costs>
          <ns0:rules>
            <ns0:rule name="Hardened Armour (entire squad)" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-hardened-rule" hidden="false">
              <ns0:description>Failed Armour Saves caused by Blast or Template weapons may be re-rolled. Reduce Advance additional distance, Charge distance and Pursuit distance by 1". Counts as Void Hardened where applicable.</ns0:description>
            </ns0:rule>
          </ns0:rules>
        </ns0:selectionEntry>
      </ns0:selectionEntries>
      <ns0:selectionEntryGroups>
        <ns0:selectionEntryGroup name="Heavy Weapons — up to four Marines" id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-heavy" hidden="false">
          <ns0:constraints>
            <ns0:constraint id="r42-role-xiv-0-legion-heavy-support-squads-hs-hss-heavy-max" type="max" value="4" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
          </ns0:constraints>
          <ns0:entryLinks>
